Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you hear that？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,They shut down the main reactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be destroyed for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,There'll be no escape for the princess this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2-D2，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,At last！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where have you been？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're heading in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are we going to do？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be sent to the spice mines of Kessel…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,smashed into who knows what！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Death Star plans are not in the main computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are those transmissions you intercepted？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.93,0:05:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,What have you done with those plans？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,We intercepted no transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is a consular ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're on a diplomatic mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,If this is a consular ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,where is the ambassador？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commander，tear this ship apart until you've found those plans…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,and bring me the passengers！I want them alive！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's one。Set for stun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Inform Lord Vader we have a prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！You're not permitted in there。It's restricted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be deactivated for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't you call me a mindless philosopher…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,you overweight glob of grease！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now come out before somebody sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Secret mission？What plans？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not getting in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,There goes another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold your fire。There's no life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must have short-circuited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's funny。The damage doesn't look as bad from out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.73,0:07:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure this thing is safe？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Darth Vader。Only you could be so bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Imperial Senate will not sit still for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,When they hear you've attacked a diplomatic…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't act so surprised，Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You weren't on any mercy mission this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Several transmissions were beamed to this ship by rebel spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to know what happened to the plans they sent you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm a member of the Imperial Senate…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,on a diplomatic mission to Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,You are part of the Rebel Alliance and a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take her away！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Holding her is dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,If word of this gets out…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,it could generate sympathy for the rebellion in the senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've traced the rebel spies to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now she is my only link to finding their secret base.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll die before she'll tell you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send a distress signal…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then inform the senate that all aboard were killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lord Vader，the battle station plans…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,are not aboard this ship…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,and no transmissions were made.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,An escape pod was jettisoned during the fighting…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,but no life forms were aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,She must have hidden the plans in the escape pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send a detachment down to retrieve them… See to it personally，Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,There'll be no one to stop us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did we get into this mess？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,I really don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,We seem to be made to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's our lot in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got to rest before I fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,My joints are almost frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a desolate place this is！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I'm not going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's much too rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,This way is much easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,there are settlements over there？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't get technical with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,What mission？What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've just about had enough of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be malfunctioning within a day…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,you nearsighted scrap pile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't let me catch you following me begging for help…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,because you won't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,No more adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,That malfunctioning little twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is all his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,He tricked me into going this way…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,but he'll do no better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait！What's that？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,A transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm saved！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over here！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！Please help！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2-D2，it is you！It is you！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Someone was in the pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tracks go off in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，sir，droids.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,We stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wake up！Wake up！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll melt us down？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't shoot！Don't shoot！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will this never end？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，fine。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！Luke！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，tell Uncle if he gets a translator…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,be sure it speaks Bocce.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like we have much of a choice，but I'll remind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，we'll take that red one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suppose you're programmed for etiquette and protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Protocol？Why，it's my primary function，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I am well-versed in all the customs…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have no need for a protocol droid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course you haven't，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not in an environment such as this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,That is why I have been programmed…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,What I really need is a droid who understands…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,the binary language of moisture vaporators.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vaporators？Sir，my first job was programming binary load lifters…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.03,0:18:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,very similar to your vaporators in most respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you speak Bocce？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Of course I can，sir。It's like a second language to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，all right。Shut up。I'll take this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take these two over to the garage，will you？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want them cleaned up before dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I was going into Tosche Station…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,to pick up some power converters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can waste time with your friends…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,when your chores are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now come on。Get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,And the red one。Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，come on，red。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle Owen！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,This R2 unit has a bad motivator。Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.09,0:19:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，what are you trying to push on us？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Excuse me，sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,but that R2 unit is in prime condition，a real bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle Owen，what about that one？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about that blue one？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll take that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take this away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be very pleased with that one，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,He really is in first-class condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've worked with him before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,O.K。Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，don't you forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why I should stick my neck out for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,is quite beyond my capacity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank the maker！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,This oil bath is going to feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got such a bad case of dust contamination…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can barely move.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，Biggs is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there anything I might do to help？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。Not unless you can alter time…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,speed up the harvest，or teleport me off this rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think so，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm only a droid…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not very knowledgeable about such things…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,not on this planet，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact，I'm not even sure which planet I'm on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，if there's a bright center to the universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,you're on the planet that it's farthest from.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can call me Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see，Sir Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh… And I am C-3PO，human-cyborg relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is my counterpart… R2-D2.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,You got a lot of carbon scoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like you boys have seen a lot of action.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,With all we've been through…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,sometimes I'm amazed we're in as good condition as we are…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,what with the rebellion and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know of the rebellion against the Empire？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's how we came to be in your service…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you take my meaning，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you been in many battles？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Several，I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Actually，there's not much to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not much more than an interpreter…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not very good at telling stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，not at making them interesting，anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，my little friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,you got something jammed in here real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,Were you on a Starcruiser or…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me，Obi-Wan Kenobi。You're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's this？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「What is what」？He asked you a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me，Obi-Wan Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me，Obi-Wan Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.37,0:21:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says it's nothing，sir，merely a malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Old data。Pay it no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is she？She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm not quite sure，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think she was a passenger on our last voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,A person of some importance，I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our captain was attached…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is there any more to this recording？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Behave yourself，R2.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're going to get us into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all right。You can trust him。He's our new master.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:22:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says that he's the property of Obi-Wan Kenobi…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,a resident of these parts…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.95,0:22:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,and it's a private message for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.87,0:22:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quite frankly，sir，I don't know what he's talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.95,0:22:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our last master was Captain Antilles.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,But with all we've been through…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,this little R2 unit has become a bit eccentric.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obi-Wan Kenobi。I wonder if he means old Ben Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.05,0:22:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon，sir，but do you know what he's talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know any Obi-Wan…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,but old Ben lives out beyond the Dune Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's kind of a strange old hermit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me，Obi-Wan Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.73,0:22:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sounds like she's in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I better play back the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.23,0:22:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says the restraining bolt…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,has short-circuited his recording system.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,He suggests that if you remove the bolt…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,he might be able to play back the entire recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，yeah。Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess you're too small to run away on me…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.75,0:22:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,if I take this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,OK…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.67,0:22:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:22:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute。Where'd she go？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.84,0:23:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring her back。Play back the entire message.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「What message」？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one you've just been playing！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.93,0:23:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,The one you're carrying inside your rusty innards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！Luke！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，I'll be right there，Aunt Beru.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry，sir…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,but he appears to have picked up a slight flutter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here。See what you can do with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just you reconsider playing that message for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't think he likes you at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.87,0:23:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I don't like you，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I think that R2 unit we bought might have been stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think that？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.93,0:23:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I stumbled across a recording while I was cleaning him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says he belongs to someone called Obi-Wan Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.35,0:23:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought he might have meant old Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what he's talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.53,0:23:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's related to Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,That wizard's just a crazy old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.61,0:24:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tomorrow，I want you to take that R2 unit to Anchorhead…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,and have its memory erased.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,That'll be the end of it。It belongs to us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,But what if this Obi-Wan comes looking for him？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.17,0:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.34,0:24:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think he exists any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,He died about the same time as your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.34,0:24:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,He knew my father？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you to forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.55,0:24:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your only concern is to prepare those new droids for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,In the morning，I want them up there on the south ridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,working on those condensers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.69,0:24:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think those new droids are gonna work out fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.23,0:24:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,In fact，I，uh，was also thinking about our agreement…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.07,0:24:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,about me staying on another season？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.41,0:24:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,And if these new droids do work out…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.70,0:24:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to transmit my application to the academy this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean the next semester before the harvest？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。There's more than enough droids.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.54,0:24:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Harvest is when I need you the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's only one season more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.80,0:24:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,This year we'll make enough on the harvest…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.51,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,that I'll be able to hire more hands…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,and then you can go to the academy next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.26,0:25:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must understand I need you here，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,But it's a whole 'nother year！
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.97,0:25:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，it's only one more season.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.52,0:25:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，that's what you said when Biggs and Tank left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.73,0:25:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.77,0:25:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm going nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.10,0:25:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have to go finish cleaning those droids.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.02,0:25:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Owen，he can't stay here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.07,0:25:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most of his friends have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.49,0:25:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It means so much to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll make it up to him next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.57,0:25:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.70,0:25:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke's just not a farmer，Owen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has too much of his father in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.33,0:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ooh！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.68,0:26:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you doing hiding back there？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.22,0:26:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It wasn't my fault，sir。Please don't deactivate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.64,0:26:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told him not to go，but he's faulty，malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.60,0:26:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kept babbling on about his mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.27,0:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,That R2 unit has always been a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.78,0:26:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,These astrodroids are getting quite out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.41,0:26:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even I can't understand their logic at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.49,0:26:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,How could I be so stupid？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's nowhere in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.37,0:26:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blast it！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.83,0:26:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pardon me，sir，but couldn't we go after him？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous with all the Sandpeople around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.17,0:26:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have to wait until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:26:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！I'm shutting the power down.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.67,0:27:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right！I'll be there in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.18,0:27:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，am I gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,That little droid's going to cause me a lotta trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he excels at that，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.07,0:27:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you seen Luke this morning？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.67,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said he had some things to do before he started today…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,so he left early.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.21,0:27:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did he take those two new droids with him？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.34,0:27:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he better have those units in the south range…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.05,0:27:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,repaired by midday，or there'll be hell to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lookit，there's a droid on the scanner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.64,0:27:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dead ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.27,0:27:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,It might be our little R2 unit。Hit the accelerator！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.50,0:28:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，whoa！Where do you think you're going？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.71,0:28:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master Luke is your rightful owner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.59,0:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have no more of this Obi-Wan Kenobi gibberish.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.18,0:28:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,And don't talk to me of your mission，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.56,0:28:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're fortunate he doesn't blast you…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.93,0:28:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,into a million pieces right here！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.47,0:28:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's all right，but I think we'd better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him now？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.31,0:28:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,There are several creatures approaching from the southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.69,0:28:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sandpeople，or worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.65,0:28:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Let's go have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.83,0:28:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，there are two Banthas down there…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.25,0:28:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I don't see any… Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.33,0:28:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're Sandpeople，all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.83,0:28:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can see one of them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.46,0:30:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here，my little friend。Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.80,0:30:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，don't worry。He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.10,0:30:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rest easy，son。You've had a busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.02,0:30:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're fortunate to be all in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ben？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.65,0:30:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ben Kenobi？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.28,0:30:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，am I glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.36,0:30:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Jundland Wastes are not to be traveled lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell me，young Luke…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.75,0:30:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,what brings you out this far？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,This little droid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.50,0:30:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think he's searching for his former master…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.17,0:31:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I've never seen such devotion in a droid before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He claims to be the property…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.72,0:31:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,of an Obi-Wan Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Is he a relative of yours？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know who he's talking about？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.22,0:31:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obi-Wan Kenobi？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.94,0:31:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obi-Wan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.23,0:31:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now，that's a name I've not heard in a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,A long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.82,0:31:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think my uncle knows him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.24,0:31:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,He said he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.87,0:31:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，he's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.79,0:31:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know him？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.58,0:31:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，of course I know him。He's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.54,0:31:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I haven't gone by the name of Obi-Wan…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,since，oh，before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.09,0:31:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，then the droid does belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.01,0:31:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't seem to remember ever owning a droid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.52,0:31:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we better get indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.23,0:31:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Sandpeople are easily startled…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.82,0:32:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,but they'll soon be back，and in greater numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.03,0:32:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.79,0:32:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where am I？I must have taken a bad step.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.01,0:32:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can you stand？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.72,0:32:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here before the Sandpeople return.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.38,0:32:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think I can make it。You go on，Master Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.01,0:32:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no sense in you risking yourself on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.31,0:32:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kind of talk is that？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.35,0:32:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quickly。They're on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.82,0:32:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，my father didn't fight in the wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.99,0:32:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was a navigator on a spice freighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what your uncle told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.82,0:32:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,He didn't hold with your father's ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thought he should have stayed here…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,and not gotten involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,You fought in the Clone Wars？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes。I was once a Jedi knight…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.04,0:32:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,the same as your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wish I'd known him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He was the best starpilot in the galaxy…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.72,0:33:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,and a cunning warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.39,0:33:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I understand you've become…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.43,0:33:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,quite a good pilot yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.27,0:33:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,And he was a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.27,0:33:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which reminds me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.52,0:33:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have something here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.40,0:33:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your father wanted you to have this…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.36,0:33:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,when you were old enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.87,0:33:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,but your uncle wouldn't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.03,0:33:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,He feared you might follow old Obi-Wan…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.70,0:33:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,on some damn-fool idealistic crusade…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.79,0:33:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,like your father did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.67,0:33:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，if you'll not be needing me…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll close down for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sure。Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.67,0:33:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's your father's lightsaber.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.55,0:33:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is the weapon of a Jedi knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.93,0:33:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not as clumsy or random as a blaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,An elegant weapon for a more civilized age.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,For over a thousand generations…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.24,0:34:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,the Jedi knights were the guardians…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.24,0:34:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,of peace and justice in the old Republic…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.41,0:34:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,before the dark times…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.33,0:34:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,before the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.46,0:34:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,How did my father die？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.21,0:34:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,A young Jedi named Darth Vader…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,who was a pupil of mine until he turned to evil…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.63,0:34:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,helped the Empire hunt down and destroy the Jedi knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.22,0:34:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,He betrayed and murdered your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now the Jedi are all but extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Vader was seduced by the dark side of the Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.03,0:34:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Force？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.65,0:34:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Force is what gives a Jedi his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an energy field created by all living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,It surrounds us，penetrates us…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.29,0:34:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,it binds the galaxy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.80,0:35:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now let's see if we can't figure out what you are，my little friend…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.01,0:35:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,and where you come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.05,0:35:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I saw part of a message he was…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I seem to have found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.89,0:35:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,General Kenobi，
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.59,0:35:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,years ago you served my father in the Clone Wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.10,0:35:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now he begs you to help him…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,in his struggle against the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I regret that I am unable to present my father's request to you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,But my ship has fallen under attack…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I am afraid my mission to bring you to Alderaan has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have placed information vital to the survival of the rebellion…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.79,0:35:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,into the memory systems of this R2 unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.75,0:35:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,My father will know how to retrieve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.66,0:35:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must see this droid…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.42,0:35:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,safely delivered to him on Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.09,0:35:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is our most desperate hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me，Obi-Wan Kenobi。You're my only hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.11,0:35:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must learn the ways of the Force…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.78,0:35:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,if you're to come with me to Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.11,0:36:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Alderaan？I'm not going to Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.66,0:36:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.24,0:36:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's late。I'm in for it as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I need your help，Luke。She needs your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.58,0:36:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm getting too old for this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.75,0:36:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.76,0:36:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not that I like the Empire。I hate it…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.43,0:36:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,but there's nothing I can do about it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all such a long way from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.02,0:36:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's your uncle talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,My uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,How am I ever gonna explain this？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.06,0:36:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Learn about the Force，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.78,0:36:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I can take you as far as Anchorhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.16,0:36:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can get a transport there to Mos Eisley or wherever you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.26,0:36:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can get a transport there to Mos Eisley or wherever you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.29,0:36:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must do what you feel is right，of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.01,0:37:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Until this battle station is fully operational…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.18,0:37:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,we are vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Rebel Alliance is too well equipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.89,0:37:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're more dangerous than you realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.98,0:37:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dangerous to your starfleet，Commander…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.48,0:37:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,not to this battle station.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.77,0:37:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rebellion will continue to gain support…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,in the Imperial Senate…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.40,0:37:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Imperial Senate will no longer be of any concern to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.66,0:37:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have just received word…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,that the emperor has dissolved the council permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.99,0:37:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last remnants of the old Republic…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.66,0:37:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,have been swept away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.21,0:37:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,How will the emperor maintain control without the bureaucracy？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.38,0:37:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,The regional governors now have direct control…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,over their territories.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.22,0:37:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fear will keep the local systems in line…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.39,0:37:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,fear of this battle station.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.89,0:37:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,And what of the rebellion？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.85,0:37:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the rebels have obtained…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.85,0:37:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,a complete technical readout of this station…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.23,0:37:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,it is possible，however unlikely…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.02,0:37:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,that they might find a weakness and exploit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.44,0:37:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,The plans you refer to will soon be back in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:38:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Any attack made by the rebels against this station…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.32,0:38:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,would be a useless gesture…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,no matter what technical data they've obtained.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,This station is now the ultimate power in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.95,0:38:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest we use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.37,0:38:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't be too proud…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.92,0:38:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,of this technological terror you've constructed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.25,0:38:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ability to destroy a planet is insignificant…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.76,0:38:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,next to the power of the Force.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.13,0:38:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't try to frighten us with your sorcerer's ways，Lord Vader.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your sad devotion to that ancient religion…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.72,0:38:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,hasn't helped you conjure up the stolen data tapes…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.31,0:38:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,or given you clairvoyance enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.40,0:38:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,to find the rebels' hidden fortre…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.57,0:38:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I find your lack of faith disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.37,0:38:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enough of this。Vader，release him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.08,0:38:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,This bickering is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lord Vader will provide us with the location of the rebel fortress…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.88,0:39:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,by the time this station is operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.80,0:39:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will then crush the rebellion…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.26,0:39:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,with one swift stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.48,0:39:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It looks like the Sandpeople did this，all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.61,0:39:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look。There's gaffi sticks，Bantha tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.44,0:39:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's just，I've never heard of them…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.61,0:39:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,hitting anything this big before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.69,0:39:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,They didn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.86,0:39:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,but we are meant to think they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.45,0:39:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,These tracks are side-by-side.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.45,0:39:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sandpeople always ride single file…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,to hide their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.75,0:39:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,These are the same Jawas that sold us R2 and 3PO.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.17,0:39:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,And these blast points，too accurate…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,for Sandpeople.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.21,0:39:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only imperial stormtroopers are so precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.76,0:39:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,But why would imperial troops want to slaughter Jawas？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.47,0:39:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they traced the robots here…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.77,0:39:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,they may have learned who they sold them to…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,and that would lead them back… home！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.23,0:39:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait，Luke！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.90,0:39:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.68,0:40:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle Owen！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.30,0:40:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aunt Beru！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.85,0:40:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uncle Owen！
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.32,0:41:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,And now，Your Highness…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.82,0:41:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,we will discuss the location…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.82,0:41:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,of your hidden rebel base.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.87,0:42:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing you could have done，Luke…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.87,0:42:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,had you been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.54,0:42:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd have been killed，too…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.37,0:42:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,and the droids would now be in the hands of the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.08,0:42:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to come with you to Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing for me here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to learn the ways of the Force…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.09,0:42:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,and become a Jedi like my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.82,0:42:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mos Eisley spaceport.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.78,0:42:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will never find a more wretched hive of scum and villainy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.12,0:42:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,We must be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.54,0:43:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long have you had these droids？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.87,0:43:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Three or four seasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.21,0:43:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're up for sale if you want them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.63,0:43:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let me see your identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.59,0:43:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't need to see his identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.01,0:43:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't need to see his identification.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.47,0:43:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,These aren't the droids you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.93,0:43:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,These aren't the droids we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.93,0:43:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,He can go about his business.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.44,0:43:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can go about your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.94,0:43:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.02,0:43:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.36,0:43:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Move along.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't abide those Jawas。Disgusting creatures！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go on，go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.92,0:44:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't understand how we got by those troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.26,0:44:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,I thought we were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.76,0:44:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Force can have a strong influence…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.60,0:44:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,on the weak-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.10,0:44:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you really think we're gonna find a pilot here…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.81,0:44:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,that'll take us to Alderaan？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.48,0:44:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Most of the best freighter pilots are to be found here…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.53,0:44:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,only watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.03,0:44:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,This place can be a little rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.86,0:44:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm ready for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.45,0:44:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come along，R2.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.46,0:45:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！We don't serve their kind here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.63,0:45:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.68,0:45:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your droids，they'll have to wait outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.39,0:45:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't want them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.64,0:45:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you wait out by the speeder？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.89,0:45:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.06,0:45:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I heartily agree with you，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.40,0:45:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.70,0:46:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.53,0:46:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,He doesn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.36,0:46:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like you，either.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.95,0:46:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You just watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.87,0:46:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're wanted men.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have the death sentence on 12 systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.54,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.12,0:46:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll be dead！
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.46,0:46:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,This little one's not worth the effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.46,0:46:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come，let me get you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.34,0:47:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aah！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.78,0:47:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewbacca here is first mate…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.95,0:47:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,on a ship that might suit us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.96,0:47:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't like the look of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.90,0:47:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Han Solo。I'm captain of the Millennium Falcon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.07,0:48:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewie here tells me you're looking for passage to the Alderaan system.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.53,0:48:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，indeed，if it's a fast ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.95,0:48:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fast ship？You've never heard of the Millennium Falcon？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.95,0:48:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should I have？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.54,0:48:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the ship that made the Kessel run in less than 12 parsecs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.67,0:48:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've outrun imperial starships.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.00,0:48:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not the local bulk cruisers，mind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.17,0:48:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm talking about the big Corellian ships now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.14,0:48:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's fast enough for you，old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.55,0:48:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's the cargo？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.31,0:48:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only passengers… myself，the boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.52,0:48:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,two droids…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.14,0:48:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,and no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.19,0:48:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it，some kind of local trouble？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.32,0:48:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's just say we'd like to avoid…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.53,0:48:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,any imperial entanglements.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.57,0:48:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，that's the real trick，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.45,0:48:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,And it's gonna cost you something extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.54,0:48:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,10，000，all in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.00,0:48:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,10，000？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.42,0:48:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We could almost buy our own ship for that！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.30,0:49:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,But who's gonna fly it，kid，you？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.63,0:49:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,You bet I could。I'm not such a bad pilot myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,We don't have to sit here and listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.31,0:49:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can pay you 2，000 now…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.52,0:49:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,plus 15 when we reach Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.65,0:49:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Seventeen，huh？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.48,0:49:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,O.K。You guys got yourselves a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.57,0:49:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll leave as soon as you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.95,0:49:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Docking Bay 94.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.16,0:49:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ninety-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.03,0:49:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like somebody's beginning to take an interest in your handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.92,0:49:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。We'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.93,0:49:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,17，000！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.43,0:49:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Those guys must really be desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.10,0:49:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,This could really save my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.27,0:49:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back to the ship，get it ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.02,0:49:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll have to sell your speeder.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.73,0:49:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's O.K。I'm never coming back to this planet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.28,0:50:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Going somewhere，Solo？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.86,0:50:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，Greedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.74,0:50:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact，I was just going to see your boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.03,0:50:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell Jabba that I've got his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.12,0:50:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.29,0:50:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should have paid him when you had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.79,0:50:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jabba's put a price on your head so large…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.34,0:50:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,every bounty hunter in the galaxy will be looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm lucky I found you first.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.47,0:50:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，but this time I've got the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you give it to me，I might forget I found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.43,0:50:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't have it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.10,0:50:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Tell Jabba…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jabba's through with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.44,0:50:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,He has no time for smugglers…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.06,0:50:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,who drop their shipments at the first sign of an imperial cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.73,0:50:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even I get boarded sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.49,0:50:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you think I had a choice？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.65,0:50:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can tell that to Jabba。He may only take your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.87,0:50:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Over my dead body.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.04,0:50:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.41,0:50:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward to this for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll bet you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry about the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.69,0:51:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Her resistance to the mind probe is considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.36,0:51:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be some time before we can extract any information from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.53,0:51:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,The final checkout is completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,All systems are operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.20,0:51:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,What course shall we set？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.21,0:51:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Perhaps she would respond…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,to an alternative form of persuasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.96,0:51:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.46,0:51:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think it is time we demonstrated…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.46,0:51:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,the full power of this station.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.30,0:51:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Set your course for Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.93,0:51:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.43,0:51:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock the door，R2.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.97,0:51:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Check this side of the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.65,0:51:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,The door's locked。Move on to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.95,0:52:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would much rather have gone with Master Luke…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.91,0:52:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,than stay here with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.49,0:52:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know what all this trouble is about…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.91,0:52:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I'm sure it must be your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.71,0:52:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,You watch your language.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.00,0:52:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right。Give it to me。I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.26,0:52:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.92,0:52:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ever since the XP-38 came out，they just aren't in demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.05,0:52:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.45,0:52:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Solo！Come out of there，Solo！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.04,0:52:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right here，Jabba.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.04,0:52:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been waitin' for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.67,0:52:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Have you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.75,0:52:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You didn't think I was gonna run，did you？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Han，my boy，you disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.84,0:53:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why haven't you paid me…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.01,0:53:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,and why did you fry poor Greedo？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.52,0:53:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Jabba，next time you want to talk to me，come see me yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.31,0:53:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't send one of these twerps.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.73,0:53:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Han，I can't make exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.53,0:53:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,What if everyone who smuggled for me…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,dropped their cargo at the first sign…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.16,0:53:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,of an imperial starship？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.91,0:53:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not good business.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.91,0:53:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Jabba，even I get boarded sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.33,0:53:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think I had a choice？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.83,0:53:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,But I got a nice，easy charter.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.71,0:53:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll pay ya back，plus a little extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just need a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.17,0:53:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Han，my boy，you're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.85,0:53:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,So，for an extra 20%…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.35,0:53:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fifteen，Jabba。Don't push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.39,0:53:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Okay，15%.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.56,0:53:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,But if you fail me again…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.81,0:53:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll put a price on your head so big…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.86,0:54:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,you won't be able to go near a civilized system.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.99,0:54:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Jabba… you're a wonderful human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.41,0:54:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.42,0:54:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the ship's as fast as he's boasting…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.59,0:54:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,we ought to do well.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.90,0:54:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What a piece of junk！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.91,0:54:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,She'll make.5 past light speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.24,0:54:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,She may not look like much…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.83,0:54:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,but she's got it where it counts，kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.58,0:54:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've made a lot of special modifications myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.37,0:54:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,But we're a little rushed，so if you'll just get on board…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.96,0:54:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'll get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.01,0:55:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hello，sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.35,0:55:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Which way？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.40,0:55:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，men，load your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.28,0:55:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stop that ship！Blast them！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.20,0:55:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewie，get us out of here！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.63,0:55:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my。I'd forgotten how much I hate space travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.48,0:55:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like an imperial cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.94,0:55:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our passengers must be hotter than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.03,0:55:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try and hold 'em off.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.74,0:56:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angle the deflector shields while I make the calculations…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.49,0:56:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the jump to light speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.63,0:56:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay sharp。There's two more comin' in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.46,0:56:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're gonna try and cut us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.34,0:56:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you outrun 'em？I thought you said this thing was fast！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.26,0:56:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth，kid，or you're gonna find yourself floating home.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.26,0:56:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll be safe enough…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.72,0:56:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,once we make the jump to hyperspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.76,0:56:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，I know a few maneuvers。We'll lose 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.77,0:56:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here's where the fun begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.81,0:56:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,How long before you can make the jump to light speed？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.77,0:56:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll take a few moments to get the coordinates from the navicomputer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.57,0:56:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you kidding？At the rate they're gaining？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.40,0:56:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Traveling through hyperspace ain't like dustin' crops，boy！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.70,0:56:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Without precise calculations…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.86,0:56:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,we'd fly right through a star…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.07,0:56:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,or bounce too close to a supernova…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.66,0:56:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,and that would end your trip real quick，wouldn't it？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.79,0:56:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's that flashing？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.91,0:56:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're losing a deflector shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.83,0:56:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Go strap yourselves in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.33,0:56:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make the jump to light speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.19,0:57:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've entered the Alderaan system.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.69,0:57:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Governor Tarkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.03,0:57:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I should have expected…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.57,0:57:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,to find you holding Vader's leash.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.57,0:57:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I recognized your foul stench…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.24,0:57:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,when I was brought on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.37,0:57:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Charming to the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.70,0:57:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't know how hard I found it…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.46,0:57:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,signing the order to terminate your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.54,0:57:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you had the courage…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.84,0:57:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,to take the responsibility yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.42,0:57:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess Leia，before your execution…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.59,0:57:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I would like you to be my guest…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.38,0:57:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,at a ceremony that will make this battle station operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.97,0:57:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No star system will dare oppose the emperor now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.18,0:57:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,The more you tighten your grip，Tarkin…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.73,0:57:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,the more star systems will slip through your fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.56,0:57:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not after we demonstrate the power of this station.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.65,0:57:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,In a way，you have determined…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.15,0:58:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,the choice of the planet that will be destroyed first.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.11,0:58:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Since you are reluctant…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.07,0:58:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,to provide us with the location of the rebel base…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.12,0:58:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have chosen to test this station's destructive power…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.12,0:58:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,on your home planet of Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.25,0:58:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Alderaan is peaceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.54,0:58:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have no weapons。You can't possibly…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.13,0:58:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,You would prefer another target？A military target？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.26,0:58:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then name the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.64,0:58:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I grow tired of asking this，so it will be the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.10,0:58:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where is the rebel base？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.31,0:58:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dantooine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.61,0:58:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're on Dantooine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.15,0:58:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,There。You see，Lord Vader？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.65,0:58:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,She can be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.20,0:58:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Continue with the operation。You may fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.11,0:58:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.70,0:58:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're far too trusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.16,0:58:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Dantooine is too remote…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.74,0:58:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,to make an effective demonstration，but don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.37,0:58:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We will deal with your rebel friends soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.37,0:58:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.71,0:58:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commence primary ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.95,0:59:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？What's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.41,0:59:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I felt a great disturbance in the Force…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.91,0:59:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,as if millions of voices…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.54,0:59:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,suddenly cried out in terror…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.54,0:59:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,and were suddenly silenced.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.21,0:59:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I fear something terrible has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.38,0:59:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd better get on with your exercises.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.13,0:59:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，you can forget your troubles with those imperial slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.97,0:59:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I'd outrun them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.98,0:59:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't everybody thank me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.14,0:59:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anyway，we should be at Alderaan about 0200 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.12,1:00:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now be careful，R2.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.96,1:00:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Argh！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.63,1:00:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,He made a fair move。Screaming about it can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.50,1:00:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let him have it。It's not wise to upset a Wookiee.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.42,1:00:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,But，sir，nobody worries about upsetting a droid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.88,1:00:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's 'cause a droid don't pull people's arms out of their sockets…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.05,1:00:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,when they lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.56,1:00:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wookiees are known to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.48,1:00:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see your point，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.06,1:00:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest a new strategy，R2.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let the Wookiee win.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.96,1:00:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，a Jedi can feel the Force flowing through him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.26,1:01:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You mean it controls your actions？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.38,1:01:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Partially，but it also obeys your commands.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.81,1:01:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hokey religions and ancient weapons are no match…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.98,1:01:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,for a good blaster at your side，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.77,1:01:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You don't believe in the Force，do you？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.19,1:01:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid，I've flown from one side of this galaxy to the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.57,1:01:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've seen a lot of strange stuff…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.24,1:01:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I've never seen anything to make me believe…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.66,1:01:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,there's one all-powerful force controlling everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.24,1:01:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no mystical energy field controls my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.46,1:01:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's all a lot of simple tricks and nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.54,1:01:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I suggest you try it again，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.55,1:01:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,This time，let go your conscious self…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.43,1:01:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,and act on instinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.68,1:01:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,With the blast shield down，I can't even see.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.10,1:01:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to fight？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your eyes can deceive you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.69,1:01:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't trust them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.20,1:02:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stretch out with your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.96,1:02:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,You see？You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.22,1:02:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I call it luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.97,1:02:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,In my experience，there's no such thing as luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.68,1:02:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，good against remotes is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.18,1:02:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good against the living，that's something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.52,1:02:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like we're coming up on Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.48,1:02:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，I did feel something.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.90,1:02:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,I could almost see the remote.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.19,1:02:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.24,1:02:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've taken your first step…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.20,1:02:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,into a larger world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.45,1:02:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.71,1:02:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our scout ships have reached Dantooine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.63,1:02:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,They found the remains of a rebel base…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.63,1:02:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,but they estimate that it has been deserted for some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.09,1:03:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,They are now conducting an extensive search of the surrounding systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.76,1:03:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,She lied。She lied to us！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.85,1:03:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you she would never…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.68,1:03:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,consciously betray the rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.18,1:03:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Terminate her immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.31,1:03:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by，Chewie。Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.57,1:03:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut in the sublight engines.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.24,1:03:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.95,1:03:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've come out of hyperspace into a meteor shower.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.45,1:03:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Some kind of asteroid collision.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.79,1:03:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not on any of the charts.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.83,1:03:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.21,1:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Our position's correct，except no Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.58,1:03:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,What do you mean？Where is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.96,1:03:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's what I'm trying to tell you，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.34,1:03:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,It ain't there。It's been totally blown away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.84,1:03:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？How？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.88,1:03:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,Destroyed by the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.63,1:03:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,The entire starfleet couldn't destroy the whole planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.05,1:03:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would take 1，000 ships with more firepower than…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.39,1:03:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's another ship coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.31,1:03:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe they know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.39,1:03:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's an imperial fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.27,1:03:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It followed us！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.48,1:03:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,No。It's a short-range fighter.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.61,1:03:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,There aren't any bases around here。Where did it come from？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.86,1:04:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It sure is leaving in a big hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.74,1:04:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,If they identify us，we're in big trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.78,1:04:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not if I can help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.87,1:04:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewie，jam its transmissions.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,It would be as well to let it go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.03,1:04:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too far out of range.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.08,1:04:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not for long.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.21,1:04:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,A fighter that size couldn't get this deep into space on its own.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.46,1:04:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,He must have gotten lost，been part of a convoy or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.21,1:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，he ain't gonna be around long enough…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.97,1:04:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,to tell anybody about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.59,1:04:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at him。He's heading for that small moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.51,1:04:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I can get him before he gets there。He's almost in range.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.73,1:04:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's no moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.85,1:04:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a space station.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.44,1:04:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's too big to be a space station.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have a very bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.11,1:04:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn the ship around.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.99,1:04:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。I think you're right。Full reverse！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.28,1:04:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewie，lock in the auxiliary power.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.71,1:04:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewie，lock in the auxiliary power！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.55,1:04:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why are we still moving towards it？！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.38,1:05:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're caught in a tractor beam。It's pulling us in！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.30,1:05:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's got to be something you can do！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.05,1:05:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do about it，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.55,1:05:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm at full power。I'm gonna have to shut down.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.89,1:05:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not gonna get me without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.94,1:05:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't win…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.35,1:05:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,but there are alternatives to fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.08,1:05:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Clear Bay 327.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.38,1:05:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are opening the magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.35,1:05:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,To your stations！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.69,1:05:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.90,1:05:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close all outboard shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.57,1:06:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close all outboard shields.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.99,1:06:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.16,1:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've captured a freighter…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.70,1:06:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,entering the remains of the Alderaan system.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.12,1:06:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its markings match those of a ship…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.95,1:06:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,that blasted its way out of Mos Eisley.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.50,1:06:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,They must be trying to return the stolen plans to the princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.13,1:06:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,She may yet be of some use to us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.80,1:06:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Unlock 1，5，7，and 9。Release charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.56,1:06:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,316，report to control.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.69,1:06:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no one on board，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.77,1:06:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,According to the log，the crew abandoned ship right after take-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.61,1:06:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,It must be a decoy，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.61,1:06:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Several of the escape pods have been jettisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.20,1:06:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Did you find any droids？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.20,1:06:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.20,1:06:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,If there were any on board，they must also have jettisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.24,1:06:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Send a scanning crew aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want every part of this ship checked.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.79,1:06:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.87,1:06:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I sense something…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.37,1:06:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,a presence I've not felt since…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.00,1:06:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get me a scanning crew in here on the double.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.67,1:07:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want every part of this ship checked.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.48,1:07:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boy，it's lucky you had these compartments.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.20,1:07:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,I use them for smuggling.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.74,1:07:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,I never thought I'd be smuggling myself in 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.49,1:07:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.95,1:07:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Even if I could take off…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.33,1:07:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd never get past the tractor beam.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.83,1:07:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Leave that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.37,1:07:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Damn fool，I knew that you were gonna say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.25,1:07:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who's the more foolish…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.67,1:07:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,the fool or the fool who follows him？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.47,1:07:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.97,1:07:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,If the scanners pick up anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.98,1:07:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,report it immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.98,1:07:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.75,1:08:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，down there！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Could you give us a hand with this？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.76,1:08:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,TK-421，why aren't you at your post？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.85,1:08:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,TK-421，do you copy？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.40,1:08:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take over。We've got a bad transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.36,1:08:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.55,1:09:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Between his howling and your blasting everything in sight…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.68,1:09:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,it's a wonder the whole station doesn't know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.35,1:09:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Bring them on！
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.97,1:09:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'd prefer a straight fight to all this sneakin' around.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.23,1:09:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've found the computer outlet，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.31,1:09:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Plug in。He should be able to interpret the entire imperial network.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.28,1:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says he's found the main controls…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.08,1:09:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,to the power beam that's holding the ship here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.58,1:09:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll try to make the precise location appear on the monitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.83,1:09:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,The tractor beam is coupled to the main reactor…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.63,1:09:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,in seven locations.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.17,1:09:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,A power loss at one of the terminals…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.80,1:09:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,will allow the ship to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.47,1:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't think you boys can help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.43,1:09:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must go alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.26,1:09:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Whatever you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.97,1:09:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've done more than I bargained for on this trip already.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.81,1:09:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I want to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.39,1:09:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Be patient，Luke。Stay and watch over the droids.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.77,1:09:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,They must be delivered safely…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.48,1:09:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,or other star systems will suffer the same fate as Alderaan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.61,1:10:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your destiny lies along a different path from mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.87,1:10:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Force will be with you always.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,You said it，Chewie.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.23,1:10:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where did you dig up that old fossil？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.77,1:10:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ben is a great man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.77,1:10:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah，great at getting us into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I didn't hear you give any ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.86,1:10:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，anything's better than just hangin' around…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.32,1:10:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,waiting for 'em to pick us up.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.61,1:10:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who do you think…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.78,1:10:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What is it？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.28,1:10:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I'm not quite sure，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.45,1:10:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,He says 「I've found her」 and keeps repeating 「She's here.」
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.91,1:10:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，who… who has he found？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.75,1:10:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess Leia.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.79,1:10:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,The princess？She's here？！
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.58,1:10:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.63,1:10:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？Where is she？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.00,1:10:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Princess？What's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.01,1:10:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Level 5，Detention Block AA-23.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.60,1:11:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm afraid she's scheduled to be terminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.06,1:11:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.19,1:11:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've got to do something！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.69,1:11:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you talking about？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.36,1:11:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,The droids belong to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.69,1:11:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's the one in the message.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.69,1:11:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We got to help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now look，don't get any funny ideas.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.28,1:11:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,The old man wants us to wait right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.53,1:11:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,But he didn't know she was here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.03,1:11:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just find a way back into that detention block.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.24,1:11:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.32,1:11:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're going to execute her.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.53,1:11:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，a few minutes ago，you said…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.12,1:11:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,you didn't want to just wait here to be captured.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.20,1:11:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now all you want to do is stay？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.33,1:11:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Marching into the detention area…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.12,1:11:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,is not what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.37,1:11:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,But they're gonna kill her！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.54,1:11:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Better her than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.01,1:11:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,She's rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.93,1:11:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rich？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.22,1:11:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm。Rich，powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.93,1:11:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen，if you were to rescue her，the reward would be…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.06,1:11:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.35,1:11:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，more well than you can imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.90,1:11:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I can imagine quite a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.40,1:11:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.57,1:11:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I better.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.73,1:11:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You will.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.28,1:11:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right，kid。You better be right about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.90,1:12:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.07,1:12:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's your plan？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.07,1:12:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.49,1:12:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO，hand me those binders there，will you？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.16,1:12:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,O.K.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.24,1:12:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now… I'm gonna put these on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.62,1:12:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,O.K。Han，you… you put those on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.67,1:12:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry，Chewie.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.88,1:12:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I know what he has in mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.46,1:12:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Master Luke，sir，pardon me for asking…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.38,1:12:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,but what should R2 and I do if we're discovered here？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.30,1:12:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.89,1:12:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,And hope they don't have blasters.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.22,1:12:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,That isn't very reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.45,1:12:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,517 to scanner control.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.95,1:12:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,517 to scanner control.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.79,1:13:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,316，report to control.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.13,1:13:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,53 to upper bay door.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.80,1:13:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,53 to upper bay door.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.44,1:13:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing in this helmet.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.93,1:13:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.68,1:13:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so before？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:14:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,I did say so before.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.95,1:14:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you taking this… thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.41,1:14:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Prisoner transfer from Cell Block 1138.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.24,1:14:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't notified.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.87,1:14:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll have to clear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.46,1:14:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！He's loose！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.88,1:14:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll tear us all apart！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.88,1:14:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll get him！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.45,1:15:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.79,1:15:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,We gotta find out which cell this princess of yours is in.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.38,1:15:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here it is… 2187.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.88,1:15:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,You go and get her。I'll hold them here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.38,1:15:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh… Uh，everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.88,1:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Situation normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.22,1:15:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.55,1:15:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Had a slight weapons malfunction…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.06,1:15:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,but，uh，everything's perfectly all right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.39,1:15:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're fine… We're all fine here now。Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.27,1:15:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,How are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.56,1:15:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're sending a squad up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.56,1:15:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，negative，negative！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.07,1:15:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have a… a reactor leak here，uh，now.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.78,1:15:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give us a few minutes to lock it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.94,1:15:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh，large leak，very dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.90,1:15:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Who is this？What's your operating number？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.74,1:15:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Uh…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.08,1:15:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Boring conversation anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.37,1:15:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！We're gonna have company！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.59,1:16:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Aren't you a little short for a stormtrooper？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.22,1:16:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.22,1:16:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，the uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.47,1:16:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm Luke Skywalker。I'm here to rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.60,1:16:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're who？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.14,1:16:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here to rescue you。I've got your R2 unit.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.40,1:16:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm here with Ben Kenobi.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.60,1:16:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ben Kenobi？！Where is he？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.90,1:16:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.73,1:16:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,He is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.19,1:16:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obi-Wan Kenobi？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,What makes you think so？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.99,1:16:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,A tremor in the Force.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.66,1:16:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,The last time I felt it…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.91,1:16:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,was in the presence of my old master.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.16,1:16:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Surely he must be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.75,1:16:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate the Force.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.71,1:16:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Jedi are extinct.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.71,1:16:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Their fire has gone out of the universe.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.04,1:16:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You，my friend，are all that's left of their religion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.59,1:16:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.22,1:16:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have an emergency alert…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.34,1:16:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,in Detention Block AA-23.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.09,1:16:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,The princess？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.35,1:16:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put all sections on alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.76,1:16:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Obi-Wan is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.35,1:17:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Force is with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.48,1:17:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you're right…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.64,1:17:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,he must not be allowed to escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.65,1:17:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Escape is not his plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.27,1:17:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,I must face him alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.70,1:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get behind me！Get behind me！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.21,1:17:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your left.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.42,1:17:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,They went down the cell bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.51,1:17:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Can't get out that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.22,1:17:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Looks like you managed to cut off our only escape route.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.93,1:17:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd like it back in your cell，Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.39,1:17:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-3PO，C-3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.89,1:17:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.27,1:17:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are there any other ways out of the cell bay？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.10,1:17:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've been cut off！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.02,1:17:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that？I didn't copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.36,1:17:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,I said all systems have been alerted to your presence，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.82,1:17:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,The main entrance seems to be the only way in or out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.74,1:18:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,All other information on your level is restricted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.82,1:18:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open up in there！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.45,1:18:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open up in there！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.41,1:18:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.20,1:18:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,There isn't any other way out！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.38,1:18:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't hold them off forever！Now what？！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.71,1:18:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is some rescue！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.55,1:18:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,You came in here，and you didn't have a plan for getting out？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.34,1:18:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's the brains，sweetheart！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.43,1:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.26,1:18:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.39,1:18:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,Somebody has to save our skins.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.06,1:18:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Into the garbage chute，fly boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.61,1:18:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.40,1:18:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there，you big furry oaf！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.36,1:18:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't care what you smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.66,1:18:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there，and don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.12,1:18:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wonderful girl！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.71,1:18:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Either I'm going to kill her…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.75,1:18:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,or I'm beginning to like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.46,1:19:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get in there！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.01,1:19:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.60,1:19:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,The garbage chute was a really wonderful idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.48,1:19:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,What an incredible smell you've discovered！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.61,1:19:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.99,1:19:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get away from there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.36,1:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.08,1:19:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you forget it？！I already tried it！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.12,1:19:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's magnetically sealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.75,1:19:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Put that thing away！You're gonna get us all killed！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.92,1:19:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,Absolutely，Your Worship.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.96,1:19:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I had everything under control till you led us down here！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.38,1:19:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ya know，it's not gonna take 'em long…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.00,1:19:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,to figure out what happened to us！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.63,1:19:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It could be worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.26,1:19:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.64,1:19:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's something alive in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.26,1:19:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.77,1:20:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something just moved past my leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.27,1:20:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！Did you see that？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.44,1:20:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.67,1:20:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Kid！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.67,1:20:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.67,1:20:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.21,1:20:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.38,1:20:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.43,1:20:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！Luke，grab hold of this！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.06,1:20:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blast it！My gun's jammed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.60,1:20:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.35,1:20:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Anywhere！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.19,1:20:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.93,1:21:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help him！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.68,1:21:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,What happened？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.89,1:21:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.10,1:21:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just let go of me and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.60,1:21:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.78,1:21:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,The walls are moving！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.78,1:21:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.20,1:21:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Try and brace it with something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.87,1:21:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help me！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.01,1:22:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Wait a minute！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.85,1:22:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.64,1:22:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in，3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.10,1:22:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.73,1:22:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where could he be？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.28,1:22:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take over。See to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.57,1:22:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，there.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.12,1:22:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're madmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.62,1:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're heading for the prison level.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.99,1:22:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you hurry，you might catch them.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.62,1:22:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.21,1:22:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,You stand guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.13,1:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.30,1:22:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.31,1:23:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,All this excitement has overrun the circuits in my counterpart here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.81,1:23:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you don't mind，I'd like to take him down to maintenance.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.79,1:23:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.79,1:23:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come in，3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.25,1:23:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.79,1:23:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get on top！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.29,1:23:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.54,1:23:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where could he be？！3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.55,1:23:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO，will you come in！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.71,1:23:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,They aren't here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.21,1:23:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Something must have happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.55,1:23:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,See if they've been captured.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.05,1:23:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.51,1:23:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,One thing's for sure…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.22,1:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,we're all gonna be a lot thinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.39,1:23:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get on top of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.52,1:23:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.57,1:23:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank goodness they haven't found them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.53,1:23:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where could they be？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.07,1:24:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,「Use the comlink」？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.74,1:24:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my。I forgot。I turned it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.16,1:24:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you there，sir？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.87,1:24:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.75,1:24:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've had some problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.92,1:24:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will you shut up and listen to me？！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.17,1:24:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut down all the garbage mashers on the detention level，will ya？！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.13,1:24:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you copy！？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.88,1:24:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut down all the garbage mashers on the detention level！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.43,1:24:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Shut down all the garbage mashers on the detention level！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.10,1:24:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！Shut them all down。Hurry！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.28,1:24:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.32,1:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ha ha！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.95,1:24:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen to them。They're dying，R2！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.16,1:24:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Curse my metal body！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.87,1:24:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wasn't fast enough。It's all my fault！My poor master.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.87,1:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're all right！You did great！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.54,1:24:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Open the pressure maintenance hatch…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.08,1:24:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,on unit number… Where are we？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.34,1:25:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,3263827！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.05,1:25:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,If we can just avoid any more female advice…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.17,1:25:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,we ought to be able to get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.51,1:25:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，let's get moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.18,1:25:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.35,1:25:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，wait！They'll hear！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.02,1:26:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come here，you big coward.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.98,1:26:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Chewie，come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.06,1:26:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Listen…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.52,1:26:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are or where you came from…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.23,1:26:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,but from now on，you do as I tell you，OK？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.28,1:26:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，Your Worshipfulness…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.32,1:26:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,let's get one thing straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.32,1:26:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,I take orders from just one person… me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.24,1:26:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a wonder you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.37,1:26:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Will somebody get this big walking carpet out of my way？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.75,1:26:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,No reward is worth this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.97,1:26:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Give me regular reports，please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.26,1:26:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.56,1:26:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Do you know what's going on？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.06,1:26:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Maybe it's another drill.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.69,1:26:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,You seen that new VT-16？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.61,1:26:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yeah。Some of the other guys were telling me about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.07,1:26:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,They say it's… it's quite a thing to see…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.28,1:26:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,What was that？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.49,1:26:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ah，it's nothing。Outgassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.16,1:26:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.66,1:27:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,There she is.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.66,1:27:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-3PO？Do you copy？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.00,1:27:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.08,1:27:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- Are you safe？- For the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.13,1:27:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in the main hangar across from the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.46,1:27:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're right above you。Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.17,1:27:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You came in that thing？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.97,1:27:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're braver than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.13,1:27:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nice！Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.60,1:27:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's them！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.60,1:27:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blast them！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.68,1:27:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get back to the ship！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.81,1:27:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where are you going？Come back！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.35,1:27:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,He certainly has courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.48,1:27:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,What good will it do us…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.94,1:27:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,if he gets himself killed？Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.09,1:28:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think we took a wrong turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.01,1:28:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's no lock.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.02,1:28:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,That oughta hold them for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.39,1:28:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick！We've got to get across.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.98,1:28:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Find the controls that extend the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.81,1:28:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think I just blasted it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.32,1:28:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming through！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.46,1:28:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here，hold this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.35,1:29:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.66,1:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,For luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.33,1:29:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,We think they may be splitting up.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.37,1:29:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,They may be on Level 5 and 6 now，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.18,1:29:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Where could they be？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.15,1:29:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close the blast doors！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.40,1:29:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open the blast doors！Open the blast doors！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.01,1:30:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you，Obi-Wan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.51,1:30:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,We meet again at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.14,1:30:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,The circle is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.35,1:30:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,When I left you，I was but the learner.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.93,1:30:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now I am the master.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.10,1:30:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only a master of evil，Darth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.41,1:30:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your powers are weak，old man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.79,1:30:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You can't win，Darth.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.50,1:30:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,If you strike me down…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.59,1:30:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I shall become more powerful than you can possibly imagine.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.64,1:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,You should not have come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.16,1:31:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Didn't we just leave this party？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.59,1:31:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,What kept you？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.75,1:31:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,We，uh，ran into some old friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.79,1:31:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,The ship all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.96,1:31:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,It seems OK，if we can get to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.80,1:31:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,I just hope the old man got the tractor beam out of commission.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.10,1:32:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.94,1:32:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，R2，we're going.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Now's our chance！Go！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.58,1:32:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ben？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.09,1:32:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.89,1:32:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.89,1:32:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.14,1:32:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.73,1:32:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，it's too late！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.98,1:32:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blast the door，kid！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.49,1:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Run，Luke，run！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.87,1:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,I hope that old man got that tractor beam out of commission…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.83,1:33:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,or this is gonna be a real short trip。O.K。Hit it！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're coming up on their sentry ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.28,1:33:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.07,1:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Angle the deflector shields while I charge up the main guns.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.33,1:33:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.46,1:33:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,There wasn't anything you could have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.05,1:34:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on，buddy。We're not out of this yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.11,1:34:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,You in，kid？OK，stay sharp.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.00,1:34:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.14,1:34:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming in too fast！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.98,1:35:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've lost the lateral controls！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.57,1:35:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Don't worry。She'll hold together.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.36,1:35:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hear me，baby？Hold together.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.51,1:35:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,Got him！I got him！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.18,1:35:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great，kid！Don't get cocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.85,1:35:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's still two more of them out there！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.38,1:36:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's it！We did it！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.92,1:36:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,We did it！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.18,1:36:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,Help！I think I'm melting！This is all your fault！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.60,1:36:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are they away？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.10,1:36:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,They've just made the jump into hyperspace.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.27,1:36:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're sure the homing beacon is secure aboard their ship？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.74,1:36:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm taking an awful risk，Vader.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.53,1:36:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,This had better work.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.49,1:36:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not a bad bit of rescuing，huh？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.29,1:36:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know，sometimes I amaze even myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.50,1:36:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound too hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.87,1:36:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,They let us go.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.29,1:36:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's the only explanation for the ease of our escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.34,1:36:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,Easy？You call that easy？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.55,1:36:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're tracking us.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.63,1:36:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not this ship，sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.42,1:37:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,At least the information in R2 is still intact.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.22,1:37:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's so important？What's he carrying？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.97,1:37:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,The technical readouts of that battle station.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.97,1:37:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only hope that when the data's analyzed…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.64,1:37:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,a weakness can be found.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.35,1:37:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.98,1:37:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,It is for me，sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.81,1:37:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look，I ain't in this for your revolution…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.65,1:37:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,and I'm not in it for you，Princess.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.61,1:37:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,I expect to be well paid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.94,1:37:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in it for the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.24,1:37:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,You needn't worry about your reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.32,1:37:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,If money is all that you love…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.03,1:37:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,then that's what you'll receive.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.54,1:37:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Your friend is quite a mercenary.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.58,1:37:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,I wonder if he really cares about anything…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.92,1:37:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,or anybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.54,1:37:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,I care.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.55,1:37:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,So…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.18,1:37:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,what do you think of her，Han？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.80,1:37:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm trying not to，kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.76,1:37:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.18,1:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Still，she's got a lot of spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.27,1:38:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。What do you think？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.77,1:38:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,You think a princess and a guy like me…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.40,1:38:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,No！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.40,1:38:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.49,1:38:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,When we heard about Alderaan…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.86,1:38:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,we feared the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.16,1:38:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,We have no time for sorrows，Commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.95,1:38:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must use the information in this R2 unit…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.87,1:38:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,to help plan the attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.91,1:39:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's our only hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.18,1:39:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.56,1:39:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're approaching the planet Yavin.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.10,1:39:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rebel base is on a moon on the far side.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.10,1:39:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,We are preparing to orbit the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.32,1:39:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,The battle station is heavily shielded…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.49,1:39:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,and carries a firepower…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.41,1:39:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,greater than half the starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.45,1:39:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Its defenses are designed around a direct large-scale assault.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.88,1:39:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,A small，one-man fighter should be able to penetrate the outer defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.25,1:39:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pardon me for asking，sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.59,1:39:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,but what good are snub fighters going to be against that？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.59,1:40:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Empire doesn't consider a small，one-man fighter…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.22,1:40:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,to be any threat…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.35,1:40:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,or they'd have a tighter defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.23,1:40:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,An analysis of the plans provided by Princess Leia…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.40,1:40:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,has demonstrated a weakness in the battle station.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.77,1:40:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,The approach will not be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.61,1:40:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're required to maneuver straight down this trench…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.86,1:40:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,and skim the surface to this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.32,1:40:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,The target area is only 2 meters wide.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.16,1:40:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a small thermal exhaust port…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.41,1:40:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,right below the main port.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.04,1:40:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,The shaft leads directly to the reactor system.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.29,1:40:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,A precise hit will start a chain reaction…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.05,1:40:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,which should destroy the station.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.38,1:40:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,Only a precise hit will set up a chain reaction.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.09,1:40:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,The shaft is ray-shielded…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.51,1:40:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,so you'll have to use proton torpedoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.35,1:40:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's impossible，even for a computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.93,1:40:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's not impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.45,1:40:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I used to bull's-eye womp rats in my T-16 back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.48,1:40:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're not much bigger than 2 meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.98,1:40:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Then man your ships，and may the Force be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.41,1:41:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Orbiting the planet at maximum velocity.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.99,1:41:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,The moon with the rebel base…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.04,1:41:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,will be in range in 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.45,1:41:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,This will be a day long remembered.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.87,1:41:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,It has seen the end of Kenobi…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.42,1:41:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,and will soon see the end of the rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.51,1:41:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,All flight crews，man your stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.97,1:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,All flight crews，man your stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.27,1:41:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,So… you got your reward and you're just leaving，then？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.48,1:41:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,That's right。Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.06,1:41:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got some old debts I got to pay off with this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.90,1:41:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,And even if I didn't…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.73,1:41:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,you don't think I'd be fool enough to stick around here，do ya？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.49,1:41:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,Why don't you come with us？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.24,1:41:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're pretty good in a fight。We could use ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.20,1:41:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Come on。Why don't you take a look around？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.20,1:41:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,You know what's about to happen…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.62,1:41:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,what they're up against.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.04,1:41:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,They could use a good pilot like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.33,1:42:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're turning your back on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.91,1:42:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,What good's a reward if you ain't around to use it？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.42,1:42:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,Besides，attacking that battle station…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.42,1:42:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,ain't my idea of courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.59,1:42:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's more like… suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.76,1:42:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.80,1:42:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself，Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.18,1:42:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,I guess that's what you're best at，isn't it？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.85,1:42:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.48,1:42:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,May the Force be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.36,1:42:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,What are you looking at？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.78,1:42:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.99,1:42:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,All pilots to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.54,1:42:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,All pilots to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.75,1:42:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.29,1:42:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，it's Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.92,1:42:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't know。I really thought he'd change his mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.26,1:42:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's got to follow his own path.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.97,1:42:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,No one can choose it for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.93,1:43:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I only wish Ben were here.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.35,1:43:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Open main launch tubes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.40,1:43:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Main launch tubes opening，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.48,1:43:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.53,1:43:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Biggs！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.69,1:43:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I don't believe it。How are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.53,1:43:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.53,1:43:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，coming up？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right up there with you…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.03,1:43:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,and have I got stories to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.83,1:43:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure you can handle this ship？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.20,1:43:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，Luke is the best bush pilot in the outer-rim territories.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.75,1:43:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'll do all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.96,1:43:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thank you，sir。I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.38,1:43:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,I gotta get aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.09,1:43:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll hear all your stories when we get back，all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.42,1:43:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.46,1:43:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，Biggs.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.63,1:43:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,I told you I'd make it someday.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.13,1:43:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be like old times，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.13,1:43:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,They'll never stop us.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.01,1:43:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，this R2 unit of yours seems a bit beat up.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.85,1:43:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,You want a new one？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.02,1:43:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Not on your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.77,1:43:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,That little droid and I have been through a lot together.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.27,1:43:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,You OK，R2？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.98,1:43:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.40,1:44:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gold squadron，begin take-off procedure.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.82,1:44:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on tight，R2。You've got to come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.70,1:44:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want my life to get boring，would you？
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.08,1:45:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，the Force will be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.76,1:45:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,Standby alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.34,1:45:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Death Star approaching.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.68,1:45:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Estimated time to firing range，15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.94,1:45:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,All wings report in.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.28,1:45:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red 10 standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.28,1:45:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Seven standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.45,1:45:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Three standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.62,1:45:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Six standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.95,1:45:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Nine standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.45,1:45:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Two standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.54,1:45:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red 11 standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.62,1:45:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Five standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.87,1:45:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,Lock S-foils in attack position.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.05,1:45:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're passing through the magnetic field.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.05,1:45:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.34,1:45:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,Switch your deflectors on。Double front.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.47,1:46:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look at the size of that thing！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.35,1:46:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Cut the chatter，Red Two。Accelerate to attack speed.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.35,1:46:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it，boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.48,1:46:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Leader，this is Gold Leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.19,1:46:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,I copy，Gold Leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.48,1:46:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're starting for the target shaft now.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.11,1:46:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're in position.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.23,1:46:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going to cut across the axis…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.44,1:46:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,and try and draw their fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.04,1:46:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Heavy fire，boss，23 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.79,1:46:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see it。Stay low.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.76,1:46:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Red Five。I'm going in.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.77,1:46:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，pull up！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.56,1:46:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you all right？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.73,1:46:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,I got a little cooked，but I'm O.K.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.78,1:47:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,We count 30 rebel ships，Lord Vader…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.53,1:47:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,but they're so small…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.65,1:47:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,they're evading our turbolasers.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.95,1:47:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll have to destroy them ship to ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.91,1:47:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get the crews to their fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.54,1:47:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch yourself。There's a lot of fire coming…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.83,1:47:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,from the right side of that deflection tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.83,1:47:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.96,1:47:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm going in。Cover me，Porkins.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.00,1:47:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm right with you，Red Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.68,1:47:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've got a problem here.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.05,1:47:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,Eject.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.01,1:47:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.05,1:47:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pull up！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.05,1:47:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,No，I'm all…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.27,1:47:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,The rebel base will be in firing range…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.48,1:47:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,in seven minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.07,1:47:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，trust your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.70,1:47:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Squad leaders，we've picked up a new group of signals.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.83,1:47:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Enemy fighters coming your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.58,1:48:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,My scope's negative。I don't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.37,1:48:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Pick up your visual scanning.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.63,1:48:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.84,1:48:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch it。You've got one on your tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.93,1:48:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hit！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.26,1:48:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,You've picked one up！Watch it！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.47,1:48:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't see it！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.77,1:48:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,He's on me tight。I can't shake him！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.23,1:48:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.37,1:48:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,Several fighters have broken off…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.37,1:48:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,from the main group。Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.79,1:48:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fall in！Fall in！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.42,1:48:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your back，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.50,1:48:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.59,1:48:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fighters above you，coming in.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.18,1:48:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hit，but not bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.39,1:48:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，see what you can do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.89,1:49:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.18,1:49:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Six，can you see Red Five？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.85,1:49:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's a heavy fire zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.48,1:49:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Five，where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.44,1:49:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't shake him！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.94,1:49:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on him，Luke。Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.65,1:49:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Blast it，Biggs！Where are you？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.33,1:49:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Thanks，Wedge.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.50,1:49:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Good shooting，Wedge。Red Leader…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.87,1:49:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,this is Gold Leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.17,1:49:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're starting our attack run.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.13,1:49:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I copy，Gold Leader。Move into position.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.92,1:49:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay in attack formation.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.30,1:49:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,The exhaust port is marked and locked in.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.02,1:49:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Switch all power…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.35,1:49:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,to front deflector screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.94,1:49:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,Switch all power…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.52,1:49:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,to front deflector screen.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.20,1:50:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,How many guns do you think，Gold Five？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.03,1:50:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say about 20 guns…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.32,1:50:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,some on the surface，some on the towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.37,1:50:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Death Star will be in range in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.33,1:50:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Switch to targeting computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.83,1:50:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Computer locked。Getting a signal.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.88,1:50:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,The guns！They've stopped！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.05,1:50:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stabilize your rear deflectors.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.55,1:50:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch for enemy fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.39,1:50:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,They're coming in！Three marks at 210.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.14,1:50:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll take them myself。Cover me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.39,1:50:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yes，sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.24,1:50:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's no good。I can't maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.41,1:50:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.58,1:50:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're too close.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.58,1:50:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay on target.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.41,1:50:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,Loosen up！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.46,1:51:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,Gold Five to Red Leader，lost Tiree，lost Hutch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.34,1:51:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,I copy，Gold Leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.71,1:51:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,They came from behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.38,1:51:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,We've analyzed their attack，sir…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.39,1:51:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,and there is a danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.89,1:51:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Should I have your ship standing by？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.43,1:51:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,Evacuate in our moment of triumph？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.44,1:51:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I think you overestimate their chances.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.27,1:51:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rebel base，three minutes and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.06,1:51:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red boys，this is Red Leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.65,1:51:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rendezvous at mark 6.1.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.15,1:51:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is Red Two flying toward you.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.45,1:51:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Three standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.45,1:51:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Leader，this is Base One.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.12,1:51:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep half your group out of range…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.70,1:51:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,for the next run.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.12,1:51:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,Copy，Base One。Luke，take Red Two and Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.62,1:51:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hold up here and wait for my signal to start your run.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.76,1:51:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,This is it！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.14,1:51:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,We should be able to see it by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.93,1:52:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,Keep your eyes open for those fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.39,1:52:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,There's too much interference.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.81,1:52:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Five，can you see them from where you are？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.02,1:52:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,No sign of any… Wait。Coming in.35.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.02,1:52:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,I see them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.53,1:52:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm in range.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.90,1:52:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,Target's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.20,1:52:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Just hold them off for a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.45,1:52:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,Close up formation.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.12,1:52:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.38,1:52:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,You'd better let her loose。They're right behind me.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.51,1:52:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.05,1:52:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,I can't hold them.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.94,1:52:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's away！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.23,1:52:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,It's a hit！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.86,1:52:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,Negative，negative。It didn't go in.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.03,1:53:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,It just impacted on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Red Leader，we're right above you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.91,1:53:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,Turn to.05。We'll cover for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.33,1:53:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stay there。I just lost my starboard engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.92,1:53:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get set up for your attack run.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.97,1:53:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rebel base，one minute and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.23,1:53:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Biggs，Wedge，let's close it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.56,1:53:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,We're going in full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.48,1:53:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,That ought to keep those fighters off our back.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.07,1:53:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,Right with you，boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.19,1:53:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，at that speed，will you be able to pull out in time？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.57,1:53:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,It'll be just like Beggars Canyon back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.91,1:53:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll stay back far enough to cover you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.25,1:53:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,My scope shows the tower…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.42,1:53:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,but I can't see the exhaust port.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.92,1:54:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Are you sure the computer can hit it？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.84,1:54:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,Watch yourself。Increase speed，full throttle.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.97,1:54:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,What about that tower？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.34,1:54:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,You worry about those fighters！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.59,1:54:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll worry about the tower！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.39,1:54:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，that stabilizer's broken loose again.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.48,1:54:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,See if you can't lock it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.49,1:54:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,Fighters coming in.3.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.75,1:54:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm hit！I can't stay with you！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.29,1:54:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,Get clear，Wedge。You can't do any more good back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.75,1:54:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.96,1:54:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let him go。Stay on the leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.72,1:54:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry，Luke。They're coming in much faster this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.30,1:54:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,We can't hold them.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.10,1:54:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，try and increase the power.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.19,1:55:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hurry up，Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.48,1:55:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Quick！Quick！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.53,1:55:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rebel base，30 seconds and closing.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.16,1:55:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'm on the leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.75,1:55:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hang on，R2.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.68,1:55:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Use the Force，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.85,1:55:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,Let go，Luke.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.98,1:55:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Force is strong with this one.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.40,1:55:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.53,1:55:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,His computer's off.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.99,1:56:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke，you switched off your targeting computer！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.99,1:56:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,What's wrong？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.70,1:56:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,Nothing。I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.26,1:56:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,I've lost R2！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.05,1:56:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Death Star has cleared the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.01,1:56:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,The Death Star has cleared the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.93,1:56:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Rebel base in range.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.68,1:56:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,You may fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.27,1:56:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Commence primary ignition.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.62,1:56:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,I have you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.58,1:56:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,What？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.79,1:56:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,Yahoo！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.58,1:56:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,Look out！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.05,1:57:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,You're all clear，kid！Now let's blow this thing and go home！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.68,1:57:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.14,1:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.24,1:57:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,Great shot，kid！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.24,1:57:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,That was one in a million！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.53,1:57:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,Remember，the Force will be with you always.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.47,1:57:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,Luke！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.89,1:58:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey！Hey！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.39,1:58:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,I knew you'd come back。I just knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.27,1:58:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,Well，I wasn't going to let you get all the credit…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.69,1:58:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,and take all the reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.11,1:58:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,Hey，I knew there was more to you than money.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.78,1:58:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，no！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.07,1:58:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oh，my。R2，can you hear me？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.61,1:58:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,Say something。You can repair him，can't you？
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.12,1:58:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,We'll get to work on him right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.03,1:58:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,You must repair him.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.49,1:58:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,Sir，if any of my circuits or gears will help…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.50,1:58:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,I'll gladly donate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.50,1:58:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,He'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.40,0:00:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久以前，在一个非常遥远的星系…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:47.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《星球大战：新的希望》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个时候，内战连连
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.40,0:00:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗军的飞船从秘密基地袭击邪恶的帝国军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并赢取了初次胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.95,0:01:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这次战争中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.75,0:01:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,反抗军的间谍窃取了帝国的终极武器「死星」的设计图
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,死星是一座武装太空站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力足以摧毁一个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在邪恶的帝国军追捕下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.05,0:01:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主急于将偷得的设计图护送回航
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.10,0:01:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它来解救她的人民，并且使整个银河系获得新生…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们毁坏了主反应堆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.04,0:02:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们肯定完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.79,0:02:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.64,0:03:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主这次无法脱身了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.00,0:04:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2-D2，你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.61,0:05:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就要从这里过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会被送到开索的乱坟场…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被捣成碎片的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,死星的设计图不在主计算机中
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你截取的那些信息到哪里去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.93,0:05:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那些设计图怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有截取任何的信息
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一艘领事飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.69,0:05:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在执行外交任务
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是领事飞船…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.24,0:06:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么大使在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,指挥官，掘地三尺也要把那些设计图找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把乘客带来！要活的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.01,0:06:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有一个，设定为击晕模式
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.06,0:06:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告维德勋爵，我们抓到了一个囚犯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，这里是不允许进入的，是禁区
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.28,0:06:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会失灵的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要嫌我啰嗦…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.49,0:06:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该去那里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在别人看到你之前快出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.79,0:06:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,秘密使命？什么计划？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.17,0:06:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要进去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:06:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会后悔的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.72,0:07:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开火，没有生命体
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.48,0:07:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面一定是些铁家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪，损坏从这里看不是那么严重
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.73,0:07:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这里安全吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯·维德，只有你才会这么的胡作非为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国参议院不会对此坐视不理的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当他们知道你攻击了外交…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.18,0:07:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要装得这么惊讶，殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.76,0:07:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不是在干什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军的间谍向你们的飞船定向传输了若干信息
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.56,0:07:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道他们发送给你的那些计划是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.53,0:07:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.36,0:08:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是帝国参议院的成员…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,去奥德兰执行一项外交任务
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是叛军的一员，帝国的叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她带走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,劫持她很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.12,0:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果事情传出去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能在参议院中会产生对叛军的怜悯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,种种迹象表明叛军间谍在和她联系
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有通过她才能找到他们的秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.22,0:08:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她死也不会说什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.14,0:08:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,发出一个求救信号…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后告诉参议院所有船上的人都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.23,0:08:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵，死星的设计图…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在这艘飞船上…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且并没有以其他方式传送走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.56,0:08:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚一个逃生舱在战斗中被扔出飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.19,0:08:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没有发现里面有生命迹象
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一定把计划藏在那个逃生舱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一支部队去把它找回来，指挥官，在我个人看来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不会有任何人阻止我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是，长官
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.26,0:09:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么这么倒霉？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.72,0:09:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎有人安排我们去受苦一样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的命运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.77,0:09:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须休息一下不然就要散架了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.11,0:09:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的关节就要冻结了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里真是个荒无人烟的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你在往哪里走？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.75,0:09:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不往那里走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里太多岩石了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.25,0:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边的看起来好走许多
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.21,0:09:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会觉得…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.26,0:09:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里会有住人的地方呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.72,0:09:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别和我谈什么技术
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么任务？你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.48,0:09:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往那里走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.65,0:09:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到一天你就会失灵的…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个目光短浅的废铜烂铁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且别让我发现你跟着我祈求帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是绝不会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.38,0:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不要冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不走那条路
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个该死的蠢货
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是他的错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:11:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他把我骗到这条路来的…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.34,0:11:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他也不会好到哪里去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.97,0:11:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个运输车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.23,0:11:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.02,0:11:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！请救救我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.12,0:14:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.96,0:14:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2-D2，是你！是你！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.71,0:15:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃生舱里曾经有人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.13,0:15:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是往这个方向走的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，长官，是机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们停下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来！起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.62,0:16:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们会把我们镕了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.60,0:16:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪！别开枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候才能结束呀？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:13.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.69,0:17:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！卢克！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.19,0:17:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，告诉你叔叔，如果他买一个会翻译的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要懂波西才行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.37,0:17:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看起来没有太多的选择，我会告诉他的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.75,0:17:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，我就要那个红色的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.51,0:17:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，不是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.55,0:17:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是被用于行使繁文缛节的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？这是我的主要功能，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对于所有的风俗习惯都了如指掌…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要你这样的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当然不需要了，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这样的环境中是不需要的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.94,0:17:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我已计划…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.36,0:17:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要一个机器人能够懂得…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.61,0:18:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,水蒸气蒸发器的二进制语言
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.61,0:18:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸发器？先生，我的首要任务是操纵二进制货物起重机…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.03,0:18:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在各个方面都和你的蒸发器很类似
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂波西语吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.16,0:18:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然懂了，先生，它就像是我的第二语言一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.83,0:18:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，你闭嘴吧，我要这个了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.13,0:18:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这两个带到仓库去，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在午饭前把它们洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我要去托西空间站呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去拿一些电整流器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把家里的事情做完
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我随便你和你的朋友们怎么浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.47,0:18:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在快干活吧，把它搞好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个红色的，过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，快来，那个红色的，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.59,0:18:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文叔叔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个R2的发动机坏了，看！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.09,0:19:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，看看你们卖给我们什么烂玩意！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.85,0:19:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下，先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.56,0:19:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个R2的情况非常好，绝对是笔好买卖
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文叔叔，那个怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个蓝色的如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.82,0:19:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会对他满意的，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.28,0:19:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的状态绝对是一流的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前和他共事过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.20,0:19:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，你可不要忘了这事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.67,0:19:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我要为你卖命
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.54,0:19:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是我该做的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.26,0:19:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢造物主！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.18,0:19:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,油浴实在是太舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙土的侵蚀让我的情况很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.06,0:19:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快不能动了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.23,0:19:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不公平了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.40,0:19:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,诶，比格斯是对的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都不能离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.48,0:19:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以帮上什么忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.57,0:20:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮不了我，除非你能改变时间
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,加快收获的速度，或者把我传送出这个乱石堆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我不能，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.33,0:20:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是一个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于这方面的知识不太了解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.33,0:20:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少在这个星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.16,0:20:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，我都不知道我在哪个星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，如果宇宙中有一个明亮的中心的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.17,0:20:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就在离它最远的那个星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.97,0:20:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫我卢克
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白，卢克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要卢克就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.01,0:20:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦…我是C-3PO仿人类机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的伙伴，R2-D2
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.31,0:20:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.81,0:20:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有很多碳化磨痕
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.15,0:20:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你们两个参与了不少行动
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过了我们所经历的一切…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.07,0:20:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时连我自己都很惊讶，我们居然能保持这么好的状态
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.95,0:20:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和反抗军他们在一起共事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.45,0:20:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们认识对抗帝国的反抗军？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我们也不会被卖到你这里来…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.62,0:20:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你懂我的意思的话，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.12,0:20:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们经历过很多战役吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.37,0:20:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些，我想
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.79,0:20:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，我没有太多的要说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过是一个翻译者…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不太善于说故事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:21:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯，确切地说不能把故事说得有趣些
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.80,0:21:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的小朋友…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.89,0:21:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个东西塞在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.81,0:21:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到过帝国战舰或是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.31,0:21:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我，欧比旺·肯诺比，你是我唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回答，他在问你问题呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.19,0:21:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我，欧比旺·肯诺比
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.69,0:21:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.62,0:21:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我，欧比旺·肯诺比
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.37,0:21:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.75,0:21:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这什么都不是，先生，只是一次故障
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.62,0:21:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧的数据，不要理它
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是谁？她可真漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.67,0:21:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不太清楚，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.13,0:21:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她是我们上次一旅途中的一名乘客
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.64,0:21:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不重要的人，我认为
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的船长和…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个录像还有其他部分吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.89,0:21:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现一下自己呀，R2
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样会给我们惹麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的，你可以信任他，他现在是我们的新主人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.86,0:22:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他属于附近的一个居民…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.36,0:22:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫欧比旺·肯诺比…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.95,0:22:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这是给欧比旺的私人信息
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.87,0:22:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白地说，先生，我并不知道他在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.95,0:22:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上一个主人是安德烈斯船长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.04,0:22:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是经过一些事情以后…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小机器人变得有些古怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺·肯诺比，我想会不会是说本·肯诺比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.05,0:22:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,请再说一边，先生，你知道他在说什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.80,0:22:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认识什么欧比旺…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.80,0:22:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,本住在沙丘之海的那一头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个奇怪的隐士
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.18,0:22:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我，欧比旺·肯诺比
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.73,0:22:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想她是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来她好像有麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.48,0:22:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好从头看一边
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.23,0:22:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说限制螺栓…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.57,0:22:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的影像系统给短路了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.36,0:22:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他建议如果你能把那个螺栓拿掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能可以为你播放全部的影像
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.70,0:22:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.20,0:22:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们两个是不能从我手里逃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.75,0:22:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我把它拿掉的话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.67,0:22:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.71,0:22:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下，她去那里了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.84,0:23:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她放出来，播放全部的影像！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.43,0:23:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「什么影像」？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚放的那个
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.93,0:23:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个修铁罐里面存着的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！卢克！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.27,0:23:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，我马上就到，贝鲁阿姨
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.40,0:23:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他好像受到一点扰动
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.32,0:23:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着，看看你能做些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.07,0:23:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.36,0:23:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是考虑一下是否播放给他看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.54,0:23:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他一点都不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.87,0:23:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.80,0:23:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们买来的R2机器人可能是偷来的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.22,0:23:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会这么想？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.93,0:23:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在清洗他的时候无意中搞出一段录像
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.47,0:23:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他属于一个叫欧比旺·肯诺比的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.35,0:23:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他也许是在说本
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.86,0:23:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他说的是什么吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.40,0:23:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.53,0:23:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他和本有关
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.82,0:24:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个巫师只是一个疯老头子
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.61,0:24:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天你把那个R2带到锚头城那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.12,0:24:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的内存清空
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就结束了，他现在属于我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这个欧比旺来找他怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.17,0:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.34,0:24:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不认为他还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.84,0:24:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和你父亲差不多一个时候去世的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.34,0:24:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认识我的父亲？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你忘了这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.55,0:24:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在需要考虑的是让这些新机器人明天开始干活
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天一早，我希望看到他们在南边的山头上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.10,0:24:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,操纵那些压缩机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.06,0:24:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.69,0:24:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那些机器人工作会顺利的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.23,0:24:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，我也在想我们协定
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.07,0:24:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关我再呆一个季节的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.41,0:24:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些新的机器人能够工作…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.70,0:24:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想今年就向学院发出申请
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.75,0:24:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说在收获前的那个学期？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.62,0:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，这里的机器人绰绰有余
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.54,0:24:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,收获是我最需要你的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.67,0:24:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过多干一个季度
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.80,0:24:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年收获应该足够…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.51,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后就可以雇佣更多的人手…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样，明年你就可以去学院了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.26,0:25:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要理解，我这里很需要你，卢克
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:06.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，这又是一整年
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.97,0:25:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是多干一个季度
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.52,0:25:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是呀，比格斯和谭克离开的时候，你也是这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.73,0:25:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.77,0:25:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都看得出我哪都去不了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.10,0:25:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去把那些机器人洗完
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.02,0:25:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文，他不能一直呆在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.07,0:25:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,大多数他的朋友都离开了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.49,0:25:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对于他来说很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:22.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明年会满足他的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.57,0:25:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.70,0:25:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克可不只是一个农民，欧文
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.20,0:25:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有太多的地方和他的父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.33,0:25:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也正是我所担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.84,0:26:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.68,0:26:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你躲在后面干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.22,0:26:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错，先生，求你不要关掉我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.64,0:26:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉他不要走，但是他似乎出了故障
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.60,0:26:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直都在嘀咕他的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.27,0:26:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，不
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个R2机器人一直都有点问题
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.78,0:26:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些航天机器人常常无法控制
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.41,0:26:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是我也常常不能理解他的逻辑
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.49,0:26:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么能这么愚蠢？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.08,0:26:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在视野之内
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.37,0:26:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该死！
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.83,0:26:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起，先生，我们可以去追他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.38,0:26:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了，到处都是沙人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.17,0:26:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要等到早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.34,0:26:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！我要关闭电源了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.67,0:27:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的！我马上就回来
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.18,0:27:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会把他找回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.76,0:27:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小机器人会给我惹很多麻烦的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最擅长这个了，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.07,0:27:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.53,0:27:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天早晨看到卢克了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.67,0:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在今天开始干活前有些事要做…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他要早点走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.21,0:27:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把那两个新机器人也带上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.76,0:27:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.34,0:27:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，他最好在中午之前把那两个机器人修好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.05,0:27:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,送到南边的山头去，不然那里就要多花很多钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.72,0:27:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，在扫描器上有一个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.64,0:27:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,直向前
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.27,0:27:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是我们的R2机器人，按加速器！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.50,0:28:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，停下！你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.71,0:28:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人现在是你的合法拥有者
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.59,0:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再说什么欧比旺·肯诺比之类的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.18,0:28:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不要再和我说什么你的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.56,0:28:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该感到很幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.93,0:28:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有向你射击把你打成碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.47,0:28:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，没事的，但是我想我们最好还是走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.27,0:28:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在又怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.31,0:28:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有若干生物从东南方向向我们逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.69,0:28:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙人，或是更糟
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.65,0:28:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，我们去看一看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.66,0:28:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.83,0:28:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面有两头本莎…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.25,0:28:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没看到…等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.33,0:28:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是沙人，没错
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.83,0:28:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看到他们其中一个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.41,0:30:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.46,0:30:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来，我的小朋友，不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.80,0:30:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，他没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.10,0:30:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了，小伙子，你今天似乎很忙呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.02,0:30:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很幸运你还是一整块
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,本？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.65,0:30:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,本·肯诺比？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.28,0:30:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计，我很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.36,0:30:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这里来应该多带些武器
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.54,0:30:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我，年轻的卢克…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.75,0:30:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么来这么远的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个小机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.50,0:30:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他正在寻找他以前的主人…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.17,0:31:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没有见过这么忠诚的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.68,0:31:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说自己属于…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.72,0:31:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个叫欧比旺·肯诺比的人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.43,0:31:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是你的亲戚吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.72,0:31:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他说的是谁吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.22,0:31:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺·肯诺比？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.94,0:31:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.23,0:31:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个名字我有很久没有听到过了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.82,0:31:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我的叔叔认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.24,0:31:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他死了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.87,0:31:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并没有死
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.79,0:31:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.58,0:31:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦，我当然认识他，那个人就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.54,0:31:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自从你出生前…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.55,0:31:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不用欧比旺这个名字了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.09,0:31:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来这个机器人确实属于你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.01,0:31:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不记得曾经拥有过一个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.52,0:31:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常的有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.27,0:31:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们最好到室内去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.23,0:31:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙人很容易被吓跑…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.82,0:32:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他们很快就会回来，而且数量更多
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.03,0:32:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.79,0:32:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪里？我刚才一定是踏错地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.01,0:32:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能站起来吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.72,0:32:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须在沙人回来之前离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.38,0:32:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我不行的，你走吧，卢克主人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.01,0:32:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能为了我威胁到自己的安全
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.81,0:32:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是不中用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.31,0:32:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，你不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说这个算什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.35,0:32:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点，他们就快来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.82,0:32:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，我的父亲没有打过仗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.99,0:32:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是香料货船的领航员
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.86,0:32:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你叔叔告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.82,0:32:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不赞同你父亲的理想
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.74,0:32:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想呆在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,与世无争
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾经参与过克隆人战争？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，我曾是一名绝地武士…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.04,0:32:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你的父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望能够了解他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.80,0:33:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾是银河中最好的星际飞行员…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.72,0:33:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一名睿智的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.39,0:33:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解你已经成为…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.43,0:33:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名优秀的飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.27,0:33:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也曾是我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.27,0:33:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这提醒了我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.52,0:33:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西要给你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.40,0:33:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲要我把这个给你…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.36,0:33:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你长大了的时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.87,0:33:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你的叔叔是不会允许的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.03,0:33:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他害怕你跟随老欧比旺…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.70,0:33:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,投身那些愚蠢的理想化的正义运动…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.79,0:33:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你的父亲一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.67,0:33:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生，如果你暂时不需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.58,0:33:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先关闭一会
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.67,0:33:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.67,0:33:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你父亲的光剑
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.55,0:33:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是绝地武士的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.93,0:33:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像激光枪那样的笨重和不稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.68,0:33:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是文明时代中的一种优雅的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.90,0:33:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士在旧的共和国中
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.24,0:34:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是和平与公正的卫士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.24,0:34:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这持续了几千代人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.41,0:34:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到黑暗时代的到来…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.33,0:34:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到帝国的诞生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.46,0:34:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.21,0:34:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个年轻的名叫达斯·维德的绝地武士…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.38,0:34:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在他投身黑暗势力之前是我的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.63,0:34:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助帝国追捕猎杀绝地武士
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.22,0:34:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他背叛了你的父亲，并且谋杀了他
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在绝地武士几乎灭绝
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.02,0:34:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德被「原力」的黑暗的一面所引诱
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.03,0:34:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,「原力」？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.65,0:34:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,「原力」是绝地武士力量的源泉
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.16,0:34:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种力场，由所有的所有的生物所产生
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.33,0:34:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它包围的我们，穿透着我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.29,0:34:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让银河紧密地联系在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.80,0:35:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们看看你是怎么一回事，小朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.01,0:35:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.05,0:35:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看过部分信息…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.76,0:35:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该已经找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.89,0:35:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯诺比将军
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.59,0:35:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,多年前在克隆人战争中，你曾为我的父亲效力
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.10,0:35:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，他祈求你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以对付帝国
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.90,0:35:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉我无法亲自向你呈上我父亲的请求
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的飞船正在遭受攻击…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕我把你带到奥德兰的计划要失败了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.20,0:35:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有对于反抗军的生死存亡至关重要的信息…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.79,0:35:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,存在了这个R2机器人的内存里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.75,0:35:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲会知道怎么复原的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.66,0:35:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要把这个机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.42,0:35:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全的送到奥德兰
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.09,0:35:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们最绝望的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.92,0:35:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我，欧比旺·肯诺比，你是我唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.11,0:35:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要学学使用「原力」的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.78,0:35:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你和我去奥德兰的话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.11,0:36:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥德兰？我不去奥德兰
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.66,0:36:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回家
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.24,0:36:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很晚了，我只能做这么多了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.70,0:36:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助，卢克，她也需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.58,0:36:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于这种事情来说我已经老了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.75,0:36:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不该卷入的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.25,0:36:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有工作要做
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.76,0:36:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我说喜欢帝国，我憎恨它
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.43,0:36:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我现在什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.76,0:36:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且到那里有很远的一段路
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.02,0:36:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你叔叔的口气
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.44,0:36:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么解释这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.06,0:36:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,学习使用「原力」吧，卢克
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.78,0:36:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,最远我可以把你送到锚头城
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.16,0:36:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那里你可以换乘运输机去莫斯艾斯利
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.26,0:36:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者其他任何你想去的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.29,0:36:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然，你必须做你认为对的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.01,0:37:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个武装空间站正常工作以前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.18,0:37:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都是非常脆弱的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.72,0:37:06.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军联盟的武器非常的精良
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.89,0:37:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们比你们想象的更危险
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.98,0:37:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的舰队来说是危险的，指挥官
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.48,0:37:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个武装空间站来说可算不上什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.77,0:37:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军会继续获取支持…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.61,0:37:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从帝国参议院那里…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.40,0:37:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再也不用去理会什么帝国参议院了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.66,0:37:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚收到的消息
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下已经永久的解除了议会
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.99,0:37:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧共和国的最后一点残余…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.66,0:37:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于被扫除了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.21,0:37:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.00,0:37:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下没有官僚机构怎么统治整个帝国
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.38,0:37:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,地方统治者有直接控制权…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.38,0:37:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有他们管辖的区域
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.22,0:37:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧，将使地方星系秩序井然…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.39,0:37:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于这个武装空间站的恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.89,0:37:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么叛军怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.85,0:37:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果叛军获取了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.85,0:37:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个空间站全面的技术信息
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.23,0:37:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能性，虽然不太可能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.02,0:37:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到这里的一个弱点然后进行利用它
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.44,0:37:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所提到的这个设计图很快就将落入我们的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.78,0:38:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军对于这个空间站任何的攻击…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.32,0:38:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将是毫无意义的行动…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.78,0:38:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他们获取到什么技术信息
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.24,0:38:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个空间站现在是宇宙中的终极力量
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.95,0:38:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议我们利用它
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.37,0:38:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要过分的骄傲…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.92,0:38:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于你建造的这个技术玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.25,0:38:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,摧毁一个行星的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.76,0:38:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,和「原力」比起来实在是不算什么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.13,0:38:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要试图用你的巫师技巧来吓唬我，维德勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.68,0:38:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对于那个古老的信仰的忠诚…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.72,0:38:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没能帮你召唤回丢失的磁带…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.31,0:38:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有给你足够的洞察力…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.40,0:38:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,去发现叛军的秘密基地…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.57,0:38:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的不敬非常的不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.37,0:38:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了！维德，放开他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.08,0:38:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种争吵是无意义的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.00,0:38:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,维德勋爵在这个空间站正常运作之前…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.88,0:39:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会向我们提供叛军基地的地址的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.80,0:39:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就去进攻叛军…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.26,0:39:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要一击致命
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.48,0:39:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来是沙人干的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.61,0:39:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，这里有手杖，本莎的脚印
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.44,0:39:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是，我从来没有听说…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.61,0:39:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会攻击这么大的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.69,0:39:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他们干的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.86,0:39:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是有人要让我们相信沙人做的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.45,0:39:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些痕迹两边都有的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.45,0:39:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙人总是一列纵队
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.74,0:39:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来隐藏他们的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.75,0:39:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这和卖给我们R2和3PO的爪哇人人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.17,0:39:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，这些爆破点过于精确
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.75,0:39:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于沙人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.21,0:39:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有帝国的突击队能够这么精确
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.76,0:39:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么帝国部队要屠杀爪哇人？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.47,0:39:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们跟踪机器人到这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.77,0:39:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能知道机器人被卖到…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就把他们引到了…家！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.23,0:39:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等，卢克！
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.90,0:39:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.68,0:40:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.30,0:40:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝鲁婶婶
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.85,0:40:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.32,0:41:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在，殿下…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.82,0:41:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来谈谈有关…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.82,0:41:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们叛军的秘密基地的地址吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.87,0:42:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真么都做不了的，卢克…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.87,0:42:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在那里的话
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.54,0:42:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会被杀掉…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.37,0:42:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这两个机器人就落入了帝国的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.08,0:42:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你一起去奥德兰
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.88,0:42:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里什么都没有了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要学习使用「原力」的方法…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.09,0:42:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我父亲一样成为一名绝地武士
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.82,0:42:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯埃斯利机场
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.78,0:42:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找不到比这里更糟的藏污纳垢的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.12,0:42:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要小心
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.54,0:43:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们拥有这两个机器人多久了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.87,0:43:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,3或4个季度
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.21,0:43:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们需要可以卖给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.63,0:43:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看你们的证件
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.59,0:43:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要看他的证件
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.01,0:43:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不需要看他的证件
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.47,0:43:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不是你要找的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.93,0:43:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些不是我们要找的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.93,0:43:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能去忙自己的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.44,0:43:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去忙自己的事情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.94,0:43:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.02,0:43:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,开走
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.36,0:43:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,开走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.92,0:44:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能忍受那些爪哇人人，恶心的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.92,0:44:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开，走开
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.92,0:44:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们怎么混过那些卫兵的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.26,0:44:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.76,0:44:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「原力」对于那些意志不坚定的人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.60,0:44:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以产生很强大的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.10,0:44:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为在这里可以找到一名飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.81,0:44:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们送到奥德兰吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.48,0:44:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,多数优秀的飞行员都在这里出没…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.53,0:44:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.03,0:44:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方可能有点危险
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.86,0:44:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.45,0:44:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧，R2
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.46,0:45:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！这玩意我们不接待！
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.63,0:45:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.68,0:45:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的机器人，他们必须在外面等着
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.39,0:45:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不让进
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.64,0:45:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如你们去车上等我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.89,0:45:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.06,0:45:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.40,0:45:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.70,0:46:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我来一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.53,0:46:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.36,0:46:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.95,0:46:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可要小心一点
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.87,0:46:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是逃犯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.16,0:46:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在12个星系里被判了死刑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.54,0:46:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会小心的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.12,0:46:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.46,0:46:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个小家伙不值得这样
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.46,0:46:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来，我给你买一杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.34,0:47:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.78,0:47:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.45,0:47:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是秋巴卡，一架飞船的副驾驶…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.95,0:47:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许能载我们
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.96,0:47:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢这样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.90,0:47:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉·索罗，我是千年鹰号的船长
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.07,0:48:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊告诉我你们需要搭乘去奥德兰星系
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.53,0:48:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，没错，如果你的飞船足够块的话
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.95,0:48:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,足够快？你从来没有听说过千年鹰号？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.95,0:48:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该听过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.54,0:48:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不到12秒差就能到达开索
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.67,0:48:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾成功逃脱过帝国战舰的追捕
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.00,0:48:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,提醒你一下，不是什么当地的那些破飞船
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.17,0:48:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是大的凯若里战舰
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.14,0:48:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，老头子，对于你来说，足够快了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.55,0:48:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,运什么货？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.31,0:48:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有乘客…我自己，这个孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.52,0:48:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有两个机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.14,0:48:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有，不要问任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.19,0:48:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么呀？在当地遇到麻烦了？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.32,0:48:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,按我的话说，我们是要躲避…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.53,0:48:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国军的纠缠
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.57,0:48:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好，这才是重头戏
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.45,0:48:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且，为了这个我要多收钱的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.54,0:48:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,10，000，全部提前支付
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.00,0:48:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,10，000？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.42,0:48:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都可以买自己的飞船了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.30,0:49:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，谁来给你们开呢？小子，你吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.63,0:49:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我可以，我是个不错的飞行员
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.80,0:49:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不要坐在这里听他说…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.31,0:49:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在可以付给你2，000…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.52,0:49:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到奥德兰以后再加15，000
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.65,0:49:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,17，000，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.48,0:49:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，你们找到你们要的船了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.57,0:49:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一准备好我们就出发
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.95,0:49:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,94号停机坪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.16,0:49:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,九十四
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.03,0:49:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来似乎有人开始对你刚才的那一剑感兴趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.92,0:49:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，我们去检查一下
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.93,0:49:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,17，000！
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.43,0:49:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人一定是走投无路了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.10,0:49:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些钱可救了我一命
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.27,0:49:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到船上去，做好准备
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.02,0:49:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把你的车卖了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.73,0:49:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题，我以后再也不回这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.28,0:50:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,要离开吗，索罗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.86,0:50:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，格里多
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.74,0:50:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上，我刚准备去见你的老板
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.03,0:50:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉贾巴我现在有钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.12,0:50:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.29,0:50:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失去那个机会了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.79,0:50:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴悬赏了一大笔钱要你的人头…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.34,0:50:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,银河中所有的赏金猎人都在找你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.38,0:50:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很幸运第一个找到你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.47,0:50:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是，这一次我有钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.76,0:50:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你把钱给我，我可以忘掉这次会面
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.43,0:50:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱不再我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.10,0:50:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉贾巴…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.85,0:50:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴看透你了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.44,0:50:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对那些一看到帝国舰队就丢掉货物的走私贩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.06,0:50:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴懒得理他们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.73,0:50:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时也会失手
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.49,0:50:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我有选择吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.65,0:50:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以自己和贾巴说，他只能拿到你的船了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.87,0:50:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我死了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.04,0:50:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.41,0:50:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等这一刻很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.60,0:51:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉添乱了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.69,0:51:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对于意识探测器的抗拒非常强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.36,0:51:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她那里获取信息需要不少时间
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.53,0:51:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终的检测完毕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.54,0:51:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的系统都正常运转
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.20,0:51:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该设定什么轨道？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.21,0:51:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她屈服于…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.96,0:51:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一种劝降的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.96,0:51:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.46,0:51:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想现在是时候展示…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.46,0:51:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个空间站最大火力了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.30,0:51:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定轨道为奥德兰
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.93,0:51:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.43,0:51:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门锁起来，R2
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.97,0:51:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查一下街道的这边
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.65,0:51:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个门锁了，去下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.95,0:52:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,与和你待在这里相比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.91,0:52:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更愿意去和卢克主人待在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.49,0:52:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这些麻烦到底是怎么回事…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.91,0:52:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我可以肯定这都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.71,0:52:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你的语言
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.00,0:52:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，给我
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.26,0:52:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.92,0:52:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从XP-38问世以后，他们就不太吃香了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.05,0:52:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些已经够了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.45,0:52:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,索罗！出来吧，索罗！
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.04,0:52:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里，贾巴
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.04,0:52:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.67,0:52:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总算找到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.75,0:52:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会以为我想跑吧，有吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.30,0:53:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，我的孩子，你太让我失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.84,0:53:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还不还钱…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.01,0:53:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你杀死了可怜的格里多？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.52,0:53:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴，如下次想找我谈话，你自己来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.31,0:53:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要派那些废物来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.73,0:53:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，我不容许例外
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.53,0:53:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果每个帮我运货的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.49,0:53:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见帝国的战舰撒腿就跑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.16,0:53:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还怎么做生意阿？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.91,0:53:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这生意可不好做哦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.91,0:53:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴，就连我也会怕阿
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.33,0:53:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我还有别的选择吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.83,0:53:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我有个很好的提议
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.71,0:53:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把钱还你的，一分不少还有得多
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.13,0:53:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我还需要一点时间
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.17,0:53:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最好的我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.85,0:53:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就20%吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.35,0:53:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五，贾巴，最多了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.39,0:53:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧，15%
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.56,0:53:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你这次又失败的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.81,0:53:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会通缉你…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.86,0:54:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你永远接近不了有人住的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.99,0:54:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴，你是我见过最好的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.41,0:54:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.42,0:54:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这飞船像他讲得那样快的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.59,0:54:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该可以成功
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.90,0:54:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么破东西啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.91,0:54:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是光速的5倍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.24,0:54:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也许看起来不怎么样…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.83,0:54:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在关键的时候是挺管用的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.58,0:54:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己做过很多的调整
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.37,0:54:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在时间比较紧，你们如果可以上船的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.96,0:54:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.01,0:55:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好，先生
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.35,0:55:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,往哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.40,0:55:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把弹药装上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.28,0:55:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那船给我截下来，炸了它！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.20,0:55:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，带我们走！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.63,0:55:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪，我最讨厌星际旅行了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.48,0:55:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是帝国的巡洋舰
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.94,0:55:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来那些人是紧咬不放了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.03,0:55:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们追上了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.74,0:56:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把防护系统调好
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.49,0:56:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做进入光速的准备程序
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.63,0:56:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意了，又有两架
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.46,0:56:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要截住我们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.34,0:56:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不加速阿？不是说这玩意儿很快吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.26,0:56:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意你说的话，要不你就不要跟着我们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.26,0:56:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要进了外太空
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.72,0:56:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就安全了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.76,0:56:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以甩掉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.77,0:56:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏就要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.81,0:56:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能上光速阿？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.77,0:56:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要先从计算机里得到我们坐标
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.57,0:56:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不回开玩笑吧？他们都快追上来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.40,0:56:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外太空航行可不像你想象得那么简单！
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.70,0:56:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有精确的计算…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.86,0:56:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能会撞上一颗恒星
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.07,0:56:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是与一颗新行星擦身而过
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.66,0:56:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们就没得玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.79,0:56:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那闪光是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.91,0:56:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的防护网要消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.83,0:56:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.33,0:56:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要进入光速了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.19,0:57:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就要进入奥德兰了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.69,0:57:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔金行政官
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.03,0:57:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就应该料到了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.57,0:57:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在控制维德
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.57,0:57:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从一上船
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.24,0:57:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就闻到了你的臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.37,0:57:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,到现在仍是这么迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.70,0:57:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我发现下达处决你的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.46,0:57:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,心里有多难过
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.54,0:57:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.84,0:57:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我下了这个决心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.42,0:57:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.59,0:57:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你被处决之前
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.38,0:57:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能参加我的战斗基地的开幕礼
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.97,0:57:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也没有一个星球敢违抗帝国的统治了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.18,0:57:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔金你越想巩固你的统治
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.73,0:57:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会有越多的反抗
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.56,0:57:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但显示了这个基地的威力之后就不会
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.65,0:57:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也帮我决定了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.15,0:58:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个星球成为他的第一个目标
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.11,0:58:03.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你不愿意告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.07,0:58:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军的基地所在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.12,0:58:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能选择你的故乡奥德兰
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.12,0:58:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为我的第一个试验品了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.25,0:58:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！那是个和平的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.54,0:58:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么武器也没有，你不可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.13,0:58:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要另一个目标吗？军事目标？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.26,0:58:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就说出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.64,0:58:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经厌倦了，这可是最后一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.10,0:58:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.31,0:58:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔图因
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.61,0:58:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在塔图因
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.15,0:58:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看，维德勋爵
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.65,0:58:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是讲道理的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.20,0:58:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续行动，准备好了就发射
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.11,0:58:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.70,0:58:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太容易相信人了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.16,0:58:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔图因太远了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.74,0:58:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示不了他的威力，不过别急
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.37,0:58:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会慢慢跟你的叛军朋友算账的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.37,0:58:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.71,0:58:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备发射
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.95,0:59:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧？怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.41,0:59:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉气不太稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.91,0:59:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像无数的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.54,0:59:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恐惧中尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.54,0:59:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后忽然安静下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.21,0:59:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是有什么不好的事发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.38,0:59:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你继续练习
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.13,0:59:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你不用担心那些臭虫了八
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.97,0:59:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了我会甩掉他们的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.98,0:59:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人谢我了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.14,0:59:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不久就会到奥德兰了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.12,1:00:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心了，R2
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.96,1:00:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.63,1:00:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他自找的，乱叫也不会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.50,1:00:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让让他吧，惹恼一个伍基人是不明智的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.42,1:00:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是没人会怕一个猩猩
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.88,1:00:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是因为猩猩不会把手臂
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.05,1:00:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从松了的接口里拔出来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.56,1:00:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伍基人知道怎么做
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.48,1:00:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.06,1:00:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个新的建议
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让伍基人赢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.96,1:00:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住了，绝地武士能感觉到气从身体里流过
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.26,1:01:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说它控制你的行动？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.38,1:01:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,部分的，但他也会服从你的指挥
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.81,1:01:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些虚伪的宗教和古老的武器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.98,1:01:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不怎么适合你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.77,1:01:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不相信气，对吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.19,1:01:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，我什么地方都去过
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.57,1:01:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也见过不少奇怪的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.24,1:01:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我却永远不能相信
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.66,1:01:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一种力量能控制一切
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.24,1:01:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何奇怪的力量能够控制我的命运的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.46,1:01:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是些小把戏用来唬人的而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.54,1:01:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，我建议你再试一次
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.55,1:01:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,随心所欲
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.43,1:01:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不受约束
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.68,1:01:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,面罩放下之后我什么都看不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.10,1:01:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我还怎么战斗阿？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛会欺骗你的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.69,1:01:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能相信他们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.20,1:02:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.96,1:02:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧，你做的到的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.22,1:02:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得是幸运
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.97,1:02:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得从来就没有幸运
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.68,1:02:27.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许对静止的物体有用
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.18,1:02:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于活动的敌人却又完全不一样了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.52,1:02:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们到奥德兰了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.48,1:02:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了一些东西
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.90,1:02:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎就能看见了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.19,1:02:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.24,1:02:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经为你的将来
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.20,1:02:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈出了坚实的一步
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.45,1:02:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.71,1:02:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的侦察船到了塔图因
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.63,1:02:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们找到了叛军基地
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.63,1:02:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们估计叛军已经撤离了有一段时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.09,1:03:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们现在正在做地毯式的搜寻
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.76,1:03:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,她撒谎！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.85,1:03:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说了她永远不会
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.68,1:03:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,背叛那群叛军的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.18,1:03:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上处决她
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.31,1:03:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，准备好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.57,1:03:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,把引擎关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.24,1:03:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.95,1:03:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从外太空进入了流星雨区域
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.45,1:03:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是行星撞击产生的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.79,1:03:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是图表上却没有显示
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.83,1:03:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.21,1:03:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的位置正确无误，但是却没有奥德兰
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.58,1:03:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？那它去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.96,1:03:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想问这个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.34,1:03:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在了，被完整的消灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.84,1:03:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？怎么做到的？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.88,1:03:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,被帝国毁灭了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.63,1:03:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是整个帝国舰队也不能消灭整颗行星阿
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.05,1:03:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会需要一千艘战舰的火力…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.39,1:03:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有一艘飞船过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.31,1:03:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们知道发生了什么
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.39,1:03:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是帝国的战船
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.27,1:03:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他盯上我们了！
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.48,1:03:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不，这是艘短程战船
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.61,1:03:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有任何基地，它是从哪里来的？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.86,1:04:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来它走的很急
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.74,1:04:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们认出我们的话就会有大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.78,1:04:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我有办法
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.87,1:04:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，扰乱他的通信系统
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走也是个不错的选择
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.03,1:04:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离我们的射程太远了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.08,1:04:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会很久的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.21,1:04:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样小的战船是不能独自进入这么深的太空的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.46,1:04:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该是从整个战队里走丢了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.21,1:04:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会活到
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.97,1:04:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,透露我们的踪迹了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.59,1:04:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,看，他正飞向那个小的卫星
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.51,1:04:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我可以在他抵达之前击落他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.73,1:04:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是卫星
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.85,1:04:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个空间站
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.44,1:04:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有这么大的空间站阿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.57,1:04:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一种不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.11,1:04:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,掉头
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.99,1:04:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，快掉头！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.28,1:04:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，把备用能源也用上！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.71,1:04:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，快把备用能源也用上！
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.55,1:04:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们还在前进？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.38,1:05:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被吸住了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.30,1:05:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定能做什么的！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.05,1:05:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也不能做，小子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.55,1:05:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是全速了，我要关引擎了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.89,1:05:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会那么容易逮到我的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.94,1:05:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了的…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.35,1:05:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还有更好的方法
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.08,1:05:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,327号仓位准备
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.38,1:05:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将打开磁场
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.35,1:05:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你们的岗位上去！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.69,1:05:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.90,1:05:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有防护网关上
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.57,1:06:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有防护网关上
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.99,1:06:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.16,1:06:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓获了一艘货船
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.70,1:06:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正试图进入奥德兰的废墟
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.12,1:06:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的外形
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.95,1:06:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟逃离的那艘吻合
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.50,1:06:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该是准备营救公主的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.13,1:06:17.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来她对我们还有一些作用
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.80,1:06:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,1号、5号、7号、9号撤离岗位
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.56,1:06:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,316到指挥室报道
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.69,1:06:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,船上一个人也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.77,1:06:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据记录指示，船员在起飞后就遗弃了这艘船
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.61,1:06:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一定是一个诱饵
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.61,1:06:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,逃生舱也不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.20,1:06:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到任何机器人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.20,1:06:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.20,1:06:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使有的话应该也逃生了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.24,1:06:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一个搜索队上去
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要彻彻底底检查这艘船
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.79,1:06:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的，长官
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.87,1:06:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.37,1:06:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一种好久没有的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.00,1:06:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫搜查队来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.67,1:07:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要检查这艘船
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.48,1:07:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面没人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.20,1:07:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好你有这些小仓位
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.20,1:07:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是走私货物用的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.74,1:07:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来就没想过我会走私自己
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.49,1:07:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.95,1:07:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我能起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.33,1:07:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也过不了那磁场
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.83,1:07:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个由我来解决
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.37,1:07:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你这笨蛋会说这个
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.25,1:07:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说跟着笨蛋的人
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.67,1:07:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是更笨呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.47,1:07:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就把船交给你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.97,1:07:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找到什么的话
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.98,1:07:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上报告
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.98,1:07:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的，我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.75,1:08:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面的人！
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.17,1:08:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以帮一下忙吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.76,1:08:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,TK-421，为什么你们不在岗位上？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.85,1:08:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,TK-421，收到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.40,1:08:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先接管，信号不太好
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.36,1:08:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看能做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.55,1:09:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的叫声和你的嘈杂声没把他们引来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.68,1:09:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是一个奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.35,1:09:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.97,1:09:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁愿堂堂正正打一架也不要偷偷摸摸的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.23,1:09:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经找到电脑接口了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.31,1:09:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,插进去，他应该可以破解整个帝国网络
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.28,1:09:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.08,1:09:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,能源系统的主控制
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.58,1:09:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找出准确的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.83,1:09:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,磁场跟主反应堆
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.63,1:09:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一共有7个联系
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.17,1:09:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何一处断连
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.80,1:09:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以让飞船离开
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.47,1:09:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们应该帮不上忙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.43,1:09:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一个人去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.26,1:09:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.97,1:09:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经仁至义尽了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.81,1:09:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.39,1:09:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有耐心，卢克
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.77,1:09:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西一定要安全的送到
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.48,1:09:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则其他系统也会有跟奥德兰一样的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.61,1:10:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟我的命运不同
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.87,1:10:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,原力会跟你同在的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.56,1:10:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你说过的，楚伊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.23,1:10:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪里找来这么一个老顽固？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.77,1:10:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,本是一个很好的人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.77,1:10:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，好的老是惹来麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.40,1:10:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没有给出什么好的建议阿
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.86,1:10:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何事都比四处闲逛
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.32,1:10:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等着被他们发现好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.61,1:10:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.78,1:10:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.28,1:10:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.45,1:10:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不停的说我找到她了，她在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.91,1:10:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到谁了？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.75,1:10:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.79,1:10:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主？她在这儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.58,1:10:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.63,1:10:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.00,1:10:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么公主啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.01,1:10:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,第五层，AA-23号囚室
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.60,1:11:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像她马上就要被处决了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.06,1:11:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.19,1:11:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做点什么！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.69,1:11:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.36,1:11:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,机器人是她的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.69,1:11:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就是信息里的人
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.69,1:11:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要帮助她
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要胡思乱想了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.28,1:11:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那老头让我们在这里呆着
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.53,1:11:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他不知道公主在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.03,1:11:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到去囚室的路
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.24,1:11:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么地方也不会去的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.32,1:11:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要处决她了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.53,1:11:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚你还说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.12,1:11:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想在这里等死
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.20,1:11:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你又想留下来了？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.33,1:11:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从来没想过
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.12,1:11:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去囚室
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.37,1:11:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们要杀了她！
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.54,1:11:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,总比杀了我好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.01,1:11:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很富有
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.93,1:11:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,富有？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.22,1:11:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有钱又有势
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.93,1:11:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你去救她的话，报酬可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.06,1:11:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.35,1:11:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,超出你的想象
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.90,1:11:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的胃口可大了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.40,1:11:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会得到的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.57,1:11:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好这样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.73,1:11:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.28,1:11:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子，最好你说得没错
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.90,1:12:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.07,1:12:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的计划是？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.07,1:12:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.49,1:12:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把那手铐递给我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.16,1:12:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.24,1:12:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在要把它戴在你身上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.62,1:12:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,汉，你来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.67,1:12:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心，楚伊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.88,1:12:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我知道他想做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.46,1:12:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克主人，请允许我问一下
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.38,1:12:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟R2被发现的话该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.30,1:12:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,关上门
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.89,1:12:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他们没有炸药吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.22,1:12:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这听起来并不怎么可靠
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.45,1:12:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,517去检查控制室
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.95,1:12:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,517去检查控制室
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.79,1:13:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,316向控制室报道
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.13,1:13:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,53到上层闸门
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.80,1:13:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,53到上层闸门
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.44,1:13:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个头盔下我什么也看不见
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.93,1:13:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不会管用的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.68,1:13:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你前面为什么不讲？
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.93,1:14:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了阿
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.95,1:14:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要把这东西带去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.41,1:14:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,转去1138号囚室
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.24,1:14:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有被通知
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.87,1:14:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我确认一下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.46,1:14:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心，他的手铐松了！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.88,1:14:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把我们都撕成碎片的！
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.88,1:14:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.45,1:15:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.79,1:15:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到是哪间囚室先
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.38,1:15:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这间-2187
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.88,1:15:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找她，我来缠住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.38,1:15:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都控制住了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.88,1:15:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,情况正常
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.22,1:15:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.55,1:15:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器有点失常
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.06,1:15:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都已经没问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.39,1:15:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很好，谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.27,1:15:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.56,1:15:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正派一个小队过去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.56,1:15:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有情况，有情况！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.07,1:15:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里的反应堆泄漏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.78,1:15:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要几分钟来解决
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.94,1:15:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,大规模泄漏，很严重
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.90,1:15:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？你的号码是多少？
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.74,1:15:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.08,1:15:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么意义的对话
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.37,1:15:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，有人要来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.59,1:16:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会不会太矮了？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.22,1:16:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.22,1:16:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的制服
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.47,1:16:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫卢克·天行者，我是来救你的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.60,1:16:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.14,1:16:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来救你的，我有你的R2
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.40,1:16:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟本·肯诺比一起来的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.60,1:16:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,本·肯诺比？他在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.90,1:16:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.73,1:16:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.19,1:16:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺·肯诺比？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.65,1:16:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会这样觉得？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.99,1:16:32.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的气在振动
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.66,1:16:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我感觉到他
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.91,1:16:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在我的老师身边
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.16,1:16:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他应该已经死了阿
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.75,1:16:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不要轻视气
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.71,1:16:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝地武士已经灭绝了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.71,1:16:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们已经在这个宇宙消失
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.04,1:16:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他们之中唯一的幸存者了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.59,1:16:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.22,1:16:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有一个警报
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.34,1:16:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在AA-23囚室
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.09,1:16:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.35,1:16:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,全面警戒
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.76,1:16:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧比旺来了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.35,1:17:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到他的气了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.48,1:17:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的判断没错的话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.64,1:17:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不容许逃走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.65,1:17:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他的计划
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.27,1:17:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要单独面对他
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.70,1:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我后面！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.21,1:17:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你的左边
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.42,1:17:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去了闸门
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.51,1:17:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里行不通
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.22,1:17:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我们唯一的去路给堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.93,1:17:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你是想回到你的囚室了，殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.39,1:17:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-3PO，C-3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.89,1:17:46.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.27,1:17:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么路能走出去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.10,1:17:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.02,1:17:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我听不到
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.36,1:17:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说已经全面警戒了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.82,1:17:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有主通道是开的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.74,1:18:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那一层的信息被限制了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.82,1:18:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.45,1:18:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开门！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.41,1:18:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.20,1:18:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没有路了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.38,1:18:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能永远挡着他们，现在怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.71,1:18:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好一个营救！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.55,1:18:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们进来却没有一个计划出去？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.34,1:18:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的，他才是策划者！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.43,1:18:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.26,1:18:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.39,1:18:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,总的有个办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.06,1:18:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,进垃圾道，快！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.61,1:18:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.40,1:18:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去你这大家伙！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.36,1:18:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不管那味道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.66,1:18:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去，什么也别想
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.12,1:18:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好女孩！
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.71,1:18:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我就杀了她
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.75,1:18:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不我会开始喜欢她
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.46,1:19:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.01,1:19:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.60,1:19:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么个好主意
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.48,1:19:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么味道啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.61,1:19:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.99,1:19:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.36,1:19:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.08,1:19:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了吗？我已经试过了！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.12,1:19:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里被磁场封住了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.75,1:19:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那东西拿开！你会杀了我们的！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.92,1:19:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错，我的神！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.96,1:19:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很好直至你把我们带进来！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.38,1:19:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会需要多久
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.00,1:19:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来知道我们去哪儿的！
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.63,1:19:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么比这个更糟的了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.26,1:19:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.64,1:19:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有生物
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.26,1:19:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的幻觉
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.77,1:20:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有东西从我的腿边经过
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.27,1:20:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.44,1:20:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.67,1:20:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.67,1:20:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.67,1:20:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.21,1:20:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.38,1:20:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.43,1:20:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，抓住这个！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.06,1:20:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的，我的枪被卡住了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.60,1:20:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.35,1:20:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便！
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.19,1:20:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.93,1:21:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮他！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.68,1:21:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.89,1:21:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.10,1:21:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们忽然松开我走了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.60,1:21:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有不祥的预感
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.78,1:21:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,墙在动！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.78,1:21:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站着不动！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.20,1:21:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,用什么东西顶住
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.87,1:21:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快帮我！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.01,1:22:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.85,1:22:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.64,1:22:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.10,1:22:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.73,1:22:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,它去哪儿了？
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.28,1:22:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到位，快找
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.57,1:22:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.12,1:22:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们疯了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.62,1:22:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去监狱那一层了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.99,1:22:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果够快的话也许还能抓到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.62,1:22:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.21,1:22:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里守着
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.13,1:22:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.30,1:22:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.31,1:23:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友出了一点故障
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.81,1:23:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不介意我想带他去维修
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.79,1:23:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.79,1:23:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快，3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.25,1:23:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.79,1:23:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,到上面去！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.29,1:23:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上不去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.54,1:23:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑去哪里？3PO
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.55,1:23:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO，你答话！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.71,1:23:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.21,1:23:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定出事了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.55,1:23:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们是否被抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.05,1:23:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.51,1:23:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事可确定
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.22,1:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都要变瘦了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.39,1:23:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到上面去
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.52,1:23:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.57,1:23:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地！帝国军还没找到他们
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.53,1:23:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪里了呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.07,1:24:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,用通话器？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.74,1:24:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忘了我把它关了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.16,1:24:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗？先生？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.87,1:24:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,3PO！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.75,1:24:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们发生了点问题…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.92,1:24:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你闭嘴听我说好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.17,1:24:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭囚犯区的垃圾库电力，好吗？！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.13,1:24:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.88,1:24:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把囚犯区的垃圾库电力都关闭！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.43,1:24:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,把囚犯区的垃圾库电力都关闭！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.10,1:24:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！全部关闭，快呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.28,1:24:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.32,1:24:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.95,1:24:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听他们的叫声，他们就要死了，R2！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.16,1:24:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天咒我吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.87,1:24:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的动作不够快，全是我的错，我可怜的主人
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.87,1:24:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没事了！太棒了，你做的太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.54,1:24:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开这里的压力门
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.08,1:24:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.34,1:25:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在32-63-827下面
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.05,1:25:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要避免再有女性建议，
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.17,1:25:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能离开这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.51,1:25:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快走吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.18,1:25:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去那儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.35,1:25:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！他们会听到
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.02,1:26:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来！你这懦夫
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.98,1:26:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,楚伊，过来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.06,1:26:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.52,1:26:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知你是谁？从何而来
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.23,1:26:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始，照我的话作，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.28,1:26:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着！殿下…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.32,1:26:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.32,1:26:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只听命于一个人，我！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.24,1:26:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着真是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.37,1:26:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁来搬开这活动地板？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.75,1:26:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有奖赏值得我经受这一切
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.97,1:26:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把我例行的报告给我
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.26,1:26:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.56,1:26:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是怎么回事吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.06,1:26:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许又是一次演习吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.69,1:26:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个新的VT-16了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.61,1:26:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,听别人说了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.07,1:26:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说它值得一看
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.28,1:26:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.49,1:26:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么正在排气
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.16,1:26:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.66,1:27:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,船就在那边了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.66,1:27:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,C-3PO！你听到吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.00,1:27:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.08,1:27:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你安全吗？- 目前是
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.13,1:27:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在主机棚，飞船那边
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.46,1:27:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就在你上面！待命
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.17,1:27:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船？
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.97,1:27:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你比我想的还勇敢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.13,1:27:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好！走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.60,1:27:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.60,1:27:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.68,1:27:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,回船去
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.81,1:27:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里？回来！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.35,1:27:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确有勇气！
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.48,1:27:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他这样丢掉自己的性命…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.94,1:27:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们会有什么好处呢？来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.09,1:28:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们转弯转错了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.01,1:28:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有锁
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.02,1:28:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应让能挡住他们一阵
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.39,1:28:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！我们得过去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.98,1:28:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,找出控制器把桥延伸出去
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.81,1:28:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚把它打坏
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.32,1:28:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们就要过来了呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.46,1:28:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.35,1:29:01.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.66,1:29:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好运
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.33,1:29:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能单独行动
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.37,1:29:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经到了5楼或6楼
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.18,1:29:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.15,1:29:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门关上！
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.40,1:29:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开！把门打开！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.01,1:30:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等你！欧比旺！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.51,1:30:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于再度见面
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.14,1:30:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,循环完成
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.35,1:30:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我离开你时是学生
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.93,1:30:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今我是大师了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.10,1:30:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶大师，达斯·维德
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.41,1:30:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的力量太弱了，老头子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.79,1:30:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢不了的，达斯·维德
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.50,1:30:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你将我击倒…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.59,1:30:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会比你所想像的还要有力
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.64,1:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该回来
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.16,1:31:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快离开这里？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.59,1:31:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被什么耽误了？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.75,1:31:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们遇到些老朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.79,1:31:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,船没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.96,1:31:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去很好，只要我们能上得去
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.80,1:31:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望老头消除了磁力牵引光束
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.10,1:32:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.94,1:32:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧！R2，我们要走了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们的机会，快走！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.58,1:32:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,本？
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.09,1:32:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.89,1:32:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.89,1:32:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.14,1:32:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.73,1:32:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，已经太迟了！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.98,1:32:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把开关打坏！
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.49,1:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑！卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.87,1:33:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望老头破坏了磁力牵引光束…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.83,1:33:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能迅速离去，好！发动！
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有他们的哨兵飞船
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.28,1:33:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,挡住它们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.07,1:33:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起防护网，将主要炮管装满
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.33,1:33:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法相信他已死了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.46,1:33:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也无能为力
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.05,1:34:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！这件事还未完呢
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.11,1:34:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进来了吗？好！保持警觉
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.00,1:34:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.14,1:34:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来得太快！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.98,1:35:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的侧面失去控制！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.57,1:35:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要担心！这船能够撑住
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.36,1:35:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝，稳住！
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.51,1:35:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打中它了！太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.18,1:35:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要就此自满
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.85,1:35:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面还有2个！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.38,1:36:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了！我们成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.92,1:36:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.18,1:36:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命！我觉得我好像在融化！这都是你的错！
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.60,1:36:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走远了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.10,1:36:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚冲进超太空
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.27,1:36:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确信追踪器装好了？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.74,1:36:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这可是冒很大的险
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.53,1:36:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这招最好有效
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.49,1:36:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还算成功的援救，是吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.29,1:36:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时连我自己也感惊奇
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.50,1:36:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不难呀
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.87,1:36:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是故意让我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.29,1:36:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们能轻易逃离的唯一解释
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.34,1:36:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻易，你说这样是轻易？
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.55,1:36:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们追踪我们
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.63,1:36:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能对这条船的
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.42,1:37:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码R2身上的情报未被破坏
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.22,1:37:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情报如此重要？它带着什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.97,1:37:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个战斗站的结构图
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.97,1:37:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望等我们分析时…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.64,1:37:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,能找出它的弱点
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.35,1:37:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事还未结束呢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.98,1:37:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我可是结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.81,1:37:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我参与此事不是为了你的革命…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.65,1:37:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是为了你
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.61,1:37:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是期望有优厚的报酬
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.94,1:37:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是为钱参与此事
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.24,1:37:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用担心你的报酬
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.32,1:37:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你就只爱钱…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.03,1:37:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你会获得的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.54,1:37:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友，好个佣兵
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.58,1:37:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他不关心任何事…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.92,1:37:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或任何人
Dialogue: 0,1:37:34.54,1:37:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关心呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.55,1:37:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.18,1:37:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得她如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.80,1:37:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量不去想她，孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:37:48.76,1:37:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.18,1:37:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我认为她很有胆识
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.27,1:38:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:38:00.77,1:38:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主配我这样的人，你觉得如何…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.40,1:38:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好！
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.40,1:38:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你获救了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.49,1:38:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我们听到奥德兰的消息时…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.86,1:38:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最害怕
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.16,1:38:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没时间伤心了，指挥官
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.95,1:38:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须使用R2身上的情况…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.87,1:38:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来策划攻击行动
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.91,1:39:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我们唯一的希望
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.18,1:39:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.56,1:39:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正接近耶比星球
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.10,1:39:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地在另一头的卫星上
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.10,1:39:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算绕耶比星飞行
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.32,1:39:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国战斗站严密的防卫…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.49,1:39:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,具有的火力…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.41,1:39:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,比半个星际舰队还要强
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.45,1:39:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的防卫措施是根据大型直接的攻击而设计
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.88,1:39:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,单人战斗机应能穿越外层的防卫
Dialogue: 0,1:39:54.25,1:39:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问，首长…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.59,1:39:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们小型战斗机对抗它又有何用？
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.59,1:40:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,帝国认为小型单人机…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.22,1:40:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不具威胁…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.35,1:40:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然他们会有更严密的防卫系统
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.23,1:40:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉娅公主所提供的敌军分析图…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.40,1:40:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,显示他们的基地有个弱点
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.77,1:40:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要接近并不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.61,1:40:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须低飞到这个狭沟…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.86,1:40:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后沿着狭沟而行，直到这一点
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.32,1:40:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击目标区仅两米宽
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.16,1:40:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个反应炉排气口…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.41,1:40:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在主排气口的下方
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.04,1:40:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,孔道直通反应炉系统
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.29,1:40:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,正中目标能引起连锁反应…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.05,1:40:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,毁灭帝国军战斗站
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.38,1:40:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有正中目标才能引起连锁反应
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.09,1:40:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,此排气口有防击保护层…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.51,1:40:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们必须使用质子弹
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.35,1:40:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这连电脑也办不到
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.93,1:40:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.45,1:40:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前在家乡常用T-16击中我的面包中心点
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.48,1:40:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还没有两米宽
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.98,1:40:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,上你们的宇宙飞船吧！愿原力与你们同在！
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.41,1:41:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速环绕耶比星球
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.99,1:41:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地所在的卫星…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.04,1:41:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,将在30分钟内进入射程
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.45,1:41:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是一个值得纪念的日子
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.87,1:41:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们己经见到欧比旺的末日…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.42,1:41:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快也要见到叛军的末日
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.51,1:41:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体飞行队员就位
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.97,1:41:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体飞行队员就位
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.27,1:41:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你领到你的赏金，你就要走了？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.48,1:41:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.06,1:41:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还有债要还
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.90,1:41:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算没有债要还…
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.73,1:41:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我会傻到留下来？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.49,1:41:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何不跟我们走？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.24,1:41:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能打仗，我用得上你
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.20,1:41:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！你何不看看四周？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.20,1:41:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道即将发生什么事？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:56.62,1:41:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道他们要对抗谁？
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.04,1:41:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们用得上你这样的好飞行员
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.33,1:42:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样是背弃他们
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.91,1:42:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人死了，赏金有什么用？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.42,1:42:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且攻击帝国军战斗站…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.42,1:42:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非我认为的勇气之举
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.59,1:42:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看更像…自杀
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.76,1:42:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.80,1:42:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,保重你自己
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.18,1:42:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是你最拿手的事，对吧？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.85,1:42:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.48,1:42:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿原力与你同在
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.36,1:42:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看个什么劲儿？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.78,1:42:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我在作什么
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.99,1:42:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞行员就位
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.54,1:42:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞行员就位
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.75,1:42:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.29,1:42:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是汉！
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.92,1:42:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道，我以为他改变主意了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.26,1:42:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须走他自己的路
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.97,1:42:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人没办法替他选择
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.93,1:43:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真希望本也在这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.35,1:43:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开飞行管道
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.40,1:43:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开飞行管道
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.48,1:43:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿，卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.53,1:43:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,比格斯！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.69,1:43:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.53,1:43:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.53,1:43:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.66,1:43:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上去与你会合…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.03,1:43:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多话要告诉你
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.83,1:43:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有把握能应付这种机型吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.20,1:43:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,首长，路克是外太空中最厉害的飞行员
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.75,1:43:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该能胜任
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.96,1:43:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢，我会尽力的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.38,1:43:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,该上机了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.09,1:43:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,回程再听你的故事好了，好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.42,1:43:38.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.46,1:43:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,比格斯
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.63,1:43:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉过你我会成功的
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.13,1:43:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像往常一样，卢克
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.13,1:43:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人挡的住我们
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.01,1:43:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的R2好像很旧了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.85,1:43:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要换个新吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.02,1:43:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不呢！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.77,1:43:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和这个小机器人合作很久
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.27,1:43:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？R2
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.98,1:43:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.40,1:44:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,金色编队，准备起飞
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.82,1:44:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住！R2，你必须回来
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.70,1:44:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想让我的生活无聊吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.08,1:45:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，愿原力与你同在！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.76,1:45:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,提高警觉
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.34,1:45:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡星球接近
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.68,1:45:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,预计15分钟内到达射程
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.94,1:45:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有飞行员向我报告
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.28,1:45:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色10号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.28,1:45:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色7号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.45,1:45:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色3号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.62,1:45:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色6号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.95,1:45:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色9号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.45,1:45:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色2号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.54,1:45:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色11号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.62,1:45:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色5号待命！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.87,1:45:46.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入攻击队形
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.05,1:45:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正通过磁场
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.05,1:45:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟紧！
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.34,1:45:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,设定防护装置，双层前护网
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.47,1:46:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西如此庞大！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.35,1:46:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭快门！红色2号，加速至攻击速度
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.35,1:46:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了，小伙子们！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.48,1:46:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色队长！这里是金色队长
Dialogue: 0,1:46:11.19,1:46:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,正听着，金色队长
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.48,1:46:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要朝目标口前进
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.11,1:46:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经就位
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.23,1:46:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要冲进去…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.44,1:46:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸引他们的火力
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.04,1:46:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,强火力，在23度
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.79,1:46:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了，保持低飞
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.76,1:46:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是红色5号，我要进去了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.77,1:46:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，拉起来！
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.56,1:46:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.73,1:46:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,机身擦到一点但没事
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.78,1:47:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有30架叛军的战斗机，维德勋爵…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.53,1:47:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们好小…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.65,1:47:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越我们的镭射光
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.95,1:47:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得一架一架毁掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.91,1:47:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让飞行员上战斗机
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.54,1:47:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体注意！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.83,1:47:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,右边的炮塔，攻击猛烈！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.83,1:47:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.96,1:47:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,掩护我，福金
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.00,1:47:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟着你，红色3号
Dialogue: 0,1:47:25.68,1:47:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.05,1:47:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,退出！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.01,1:47:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.05,1:47:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉起来！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.05,1:47:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.27,1:47:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.48,1:47:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在7分钟内进入射程
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.07,1:47:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克，信任你的感觉
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.70,1:47:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行领队，我们收到新的信号
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.83,1:47:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌军战斗机朝你的方向飞去
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.58,1:48:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的扫描器上没有显示，我什么也没看到
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.37,1:48:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你的目视扫描
Dialogue: 0,1:48:01.63,1:48:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.84,1:48:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心了！有一个在你尾巴后面
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.93,1:48:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,击中了！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.26,1:48:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,已击中一架，小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.47,1:48:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.77,1:48:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟得很紧，无法摔掉它！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.23,1:48:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就来了
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.37,1:48:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个战斗机脱离主队…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.37,1:48:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来掩护我
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.79,1:48:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合！集合！
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.42,1:48:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的后面，卢克
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.50,1:48:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心你的后面
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.59,1:48:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌机逼近
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.18,1:48:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被击中，但还好
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.39,1:48:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，看你能不能想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.89,1:49:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.18,1:49:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色6号，你看到红色5号吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.85,1:49:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮火还是很猛
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.48,1:49:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色5号，你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.44,1:49:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摆脱不了他！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.94,1:49:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住！卢克
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.65,1:49:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,比格斯！你在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.33,1:49:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了，威治
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.50,1:49:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,打的好！
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.87,1:49:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是金色队长
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.17,1:49:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要开始我们的行动
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.13,1:49:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，队长，马上就位
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.92,1:49:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击队形
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.30,1:49:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁定排气孔
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.02,1:49:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把动力转至…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.35,1:49:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有动力转到前面防弹
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.94,1:49:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,把动力转至…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.52,1:49:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有动力转到前面防弹
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.20,1:50:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看有多少火炮，金色5号？
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.03,1:50:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约20门
Dialogue: 0,1:50:03.32,1:50:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些在表面，有些在塔上
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.37,1:50:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡星球5分钟内进入射程
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.33,1:50:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动瞄准电脑
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.83,1:50:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,电脑收到讯号
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.88,1:50:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,大炮…停止发射了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.05,1:50:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住你们的尾部变流器
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.55,1:50:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心敌军战斗机
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.39,1:50:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了！有3架在2点10分位置
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.14,1:50:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的侧位，掩护我
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.39,1:50:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.24,1:50:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法行动
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.41,1:50:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟目标
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.58,1:50:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们太近了
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.58,1:50:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟目标
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.41,1:50:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离远一点！
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.46,1:51:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,金色呼叫红色队长，失去两架战机
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.34,1:51:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，金色队长
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.71,1:51:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从后面来的
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.38,1:51:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,已分析他们的攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.39,1:51:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有危险
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.89,1:51:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我准备好你的宇宙飞船吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.43,1:51:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们胜利的时刻撤退？
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.44,1:51:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看你高估他们的机会了
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.27,1:51:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地3分钟，接近中
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.06,1:51:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色战斗机，这里是红色队长
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.65,1:51:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,61位置会合
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.15,1:51:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是红色2号，向你飞来
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.45,1:51:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色3号待命
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.45,1:51:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色队长，这里是一号基地
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.12,1:51:35.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,保留一半人马…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.70,1:51:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备展开下一波行动
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.12,1:51:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了，一号基地路克，红色2号及3号
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.62,1:51:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿等我的讯号展开你们的行动
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.76,1:51:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是了！
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.14,1:51:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在应该已经看到
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.93,1:52:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意那些战斗机
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.39,1:52:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多干扰
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.81,1:52:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色5号，你能看到敌军战斗机吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.02,1:52:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么也没看…慢着！3点5分方向
Dialogue: 0,1:52:09.02,1:52:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.53,1:52:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入射程
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.90,1:52:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标快要到了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.20,1:52:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要挡住他们几秒钟
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.45,1:52:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,排成对形
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.12,1:52:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.38,1:52:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摆脱不掉他们，他们就在我后面
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.51,1:52:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快到了
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.05,1:52:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挡不住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.94,1:52:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射了！
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.23,1:52:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,击中了吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.86,1:52:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没中！没中！没进去
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.03,1:53:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在表面爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.20,1:53:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,红色队长，我们就在你上面
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.91,1:53:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,转向05方向，我会掩护你
Dialogue: 0,1:53:12.33,1:53:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚损失右舷引擎
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.92,1:53:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开你的攻击行动
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.97,1:53:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地，一分钟，继续接近
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.23,1:53:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,比格斯、威治，我们向目标接近
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.56,1:53:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要全力冲进去
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.48,1:53:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替我挡住那些战斗机
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.07,1:53:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧跟着你
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.19,1:53:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的速度能及时击中吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.57,1:53:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题，顺顺利利地
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.91,1:53:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在你后面，掩护你
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.25,1:53:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得到塔…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:57.42,1:53:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但看不到排气口
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.92,1:54:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确信电脑能击中吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.84,1:54:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己要小心，要加速前速
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.97,1:54:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,炮塔呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.34,1:54:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你管敌机！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.59,1:54:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来管炮塔！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.39,1:54:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，稳定器又松了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:18.48,1:54:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它固定好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:54:28.49,1:54:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌机来了，3点方向
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.75,1:54:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被击中，我不能跟你了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.29,1:54:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,退开，威治，你在后面也帮不了忙
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.75,1:54:44.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.96,1:54:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他走！跟着领队战斗机
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.72,1:54:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！卢克，这次他们速度更快
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.30,1:54:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们挡不住他们
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.10,1:54:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，加速！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.19,1:55:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.48,1:55:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.53,1:55:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地，30秒，继续接近
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.16,1:55:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来对付领队
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.75,1:55:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持下去！R2
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.68,1:55:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用宇宙之原力，卢克
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.85,1:55:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手去作！
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.98,1:55:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这架原力很强烈
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.40,1:55:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！相信我
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.53,1:55:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的电脑关掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.99,1:56:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,路克！你关掉瞄准的电脑！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.99,1:56:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.70,1:56:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事！我很好
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.26,1:56:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我损失了R2！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.05,1:56:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球受到威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.01,1:56:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,星球受到威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.93,1:56:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军基地在射程内
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.68,1:56:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了就射击
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.27,1:56:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始第一次点火！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.62,1:56:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逮到你了！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.58,1:56:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.79,1:56:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！！
Dialogue: 0,1:56:54.58,1:56:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.05,1:57:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没障碍了，小子，现在快炸掉目标，我们回家
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.68,1:57:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.14,1:57:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,预备！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.24,1:57:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,射得好，小子！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.24,1:57:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,百里挑一
Dialogue: 0,1:57:31.53,1:57:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着！原力将与你同在…永远
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.47,1:57:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢克！
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.89,1:58:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！嘿！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.39,1:58:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你会回来！我就知道
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.27,1:58:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不让你独享功劳…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.69,1:58:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走所有赏金
Dialogue: 0,1:58:06.11,1:58:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你不是只看重钱
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.78,1:58:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.07,1:58:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,R2，你能听到我说话吗？说话呀！
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.61,1:58:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说点什么，你能修理他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.12,1:58:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们马上着手
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.03,1:58:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定把他修好
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.49,1:58:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有什么电路能帮助…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.50,1:58:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意提供
Dialogue: 0,1:58:22.50,1:58:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会修复的
